{"name":"Addiction","type":"talent","img":"icons/magic/movement/abstract-ribbons-red-orange.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"addiction","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"flaw","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"addiction","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"flaws-mental","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Dépendance (Addiction)","system":{"description":"<h1>Dépendance (Addiction)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous êtes dépendant d’une substance, d’un produit ou d’une pratique précise. La dépendance est définie par la rareté de ce dont vous avez besoin et par la gravité du manque, depuis une habitude contraignante jusqu’à une addiction potentiellement mortelle.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><ul><li><strong>Tier I :</strong> dépendance réelle mais effets de manque modérés.</li><li><strong>Tier II :</strong> dépendance sérieuse, avec conséquences importantes en cas de manque.</li><li><strong>Tier III :</strong> dépendance dangereuse, potentiellement destructrice pour la santé ou le comportement.</li></ul><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>La substance et ses effets précis sont définis avec le MJ. Le Défaut doit créer une contrainte régulière : nécessité de se procurer le produit, symptômes de manque, pénalités ou risques lorsque la dépendance n’est pas satisfaite.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Addiction","system":{"description":"<h1>Addiction</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You are dependent on a specific substance, product, or practice. The addiction is defined by the rarity of what you need and by the severity of withdrawal, ranging from a burdensome habit to a potentially lethal dependency.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><ul><li><strong>Tier I:</strong> genuine dependency with moderate withdrawal effects.</li><li><strong>Tier II:</strong> serious dependency with important consequences when deprived.</li><li><strong>Tier III:</strong> dangerous dependency, potentially destructive to health or behavior.</li></ul><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The substance and its exact effects are defined with the GM. The Flaw must create a recurring constraint: the need to obtain the substance, withdrawal symptoms, penalties, or risks when the addiction is not satisfied.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Défauts — Mentaux"],"en":["Flaws — Mental"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["flaws-mental"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Other","name":"Addiction","cost":"-5/Tier","tier":0,"maxTier":3,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Addiction</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You are dependent on a specific substance, product, or practice. The addiction is defined by the rarity of what you need and by the severity of withdrawal, ranging from a burdensome habit to a potentially lethal dependency.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><ul><li><strong>Tier I:</strong> genuine dependency with moderate withdrawal effects.</li><li><strong>Tier II:</strong> serious dependency with important consequences when deprived.</li><li><strong>Tier III:</strong> dangerous dependency, potentially destructive to health or behavior.</li></ul><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The substance and its exact effects are defined with the GM. The Flaw must create a recurring constraint: the need to obtain the substance, withdrawal symptoms, penalties, or risks when the addiction is not satisfied.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_addiction.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"6yEAbAIIvA09XjzT"}
{"name":"Allergy","type":"talent","img":"icons/magic/movement/abstract-ribbons-red-orange.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"allergy","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"flaw","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"allergy","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"flaws-physical","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Allergie (Allergy)","system":{"description":"<h1>Allergie (Allergy)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous souffrez d’une réaction physique à une substance définie lors de l’acquisition du Défaut. L’allergie peut être rare ou commune et provoquer larmoiement, écoulement nasal, gêne respiratoire ou fortes pénalités après une exposition suffisante ; sa gravité dépend de sa fréquence et de sa sévérité.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><ul><li><strong>Tier I :</strong> allergène peu fréquent ou effet gênant mais limité.</li><li><strong>Tier II :</strong> allergène courant ou réaction nettement handicapante.</li><li><strong>Tier III :</strong> allergie très contraignante, fréquente ou sévère.</li></ul><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Le déclencheur doit être approuvé par le MJ et réellement susceptible d’entrer en jeu. Les pénalités exactes sont adaptées au contexte RMU ; une exposition significative doit produire une gêne mécanique cohérente plutôt qu’un simple élément décoratif.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Allergy","system":{"description":"<h1>Allergy</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You suffer a physical reaction to a substance defined when the Flaw is acquired. The allergen may be rare or common and can cause watering eyes, a runny nose, breathing difficulty, or severe penalties after sufficient exposure; its impact depends on both frequency and severity.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><ul><li><strong>Tier I:</strong> uncommon allergen or an inconvenient but limited effect.</li><li><strong>Tier II:</strong> common allergen or a clearly disabling reaction.</li><li><strong>Tier III:</strong> a highly restrictive, frequent, or severe allergy.</li></ul><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The trigger must be approved by the GM and must realistically be capable of appearing in play. Exact penalties are adapted to the RMU context; meaningful exposure should produce a coherent mechanical hindrance rather than remain merely decorative.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Défauts — Physiques"],"en":["Flaws — Physical"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["flaws-physical"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Physical","name":"Allergy","cost":"-5/Tier","tier":0,"maxTier":3,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Allergy</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You suffer a physical reaction to a substance defined when the Flaw is acquired. The allergen may be rare or common and can cause watering eyes, a runny nose, breathing difficulty, or severe penalties after sufficient exposure; its impact depends on both frequency and severity.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><ul><li><strong>Tier I:</strong> uncommon allergen or an inconvenient but limited effect.</li><li><strong>Tier II:</strong> common allergen or a clearly disabling reaction.</li><li><strong>Tier III:</strong> a highly restrictive, frequent, or severe allergy.</li></ul><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The trigger must be approved by the GM and must realistically be capable of appearing in play. Exact penalties are adapted to the RMU context; meaningful exposure should produce a coherent mechanical hindrance rather than remain merely decorative.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_allergy.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"e43ECywnV4rBpnFe"}
{"name":"Aura of Aman","type":"talent","img":"icons/skills/movement/ball-spinning-blue.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"aura-of-aman","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"talent","restrictions":{"cultures":["Noldor"]},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"aura-of-aman","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"talents-cultural","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Aura d’Aman (Aura of Aman)","system":{"description":"<h1>Aura d’Aman (Aura of Aman)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Une bénédiction curative liée aux Terres Immortelles traverse votre lignée. Le premier Tier représente un personnage dont un ou deux parents sont nés en Aman et lui confère des capacités curatives innées limitées. Le second Tier concerne un personnage lui-même né en Aman et renforce fortement ces capacités. Les soins exigent le contact et mobilisent une part importante de votre énergie.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Donner gratuitement plusieurs Listes complètes serait disproportionné en RMU. Le Talent est donc conservé à <strong>deux Tiers</strong> sous forme de capacités curatives innées ciblées, définies avec le MJ à partir de soins du sang, des os, des muscles/tendons/ligaments et de purification. Les soins exigent le contact et doivent conserver un coût ou une limitation d’usage significative. Le Tier II représente une puissance nettement supérieure et suppose une naissance en Aman ou une justification équivalente.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Aura of Aman","system":{"description":"<h1>Aura of Aman</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>A healing blessing linked to the Undying Lands runs through your lineage. The first Tier represents a character with one or two parents born in Aman and grants limited innate healing abilities. The second Tier concerns a character personally born in Aman and greatly strengthens these abilities. Healing requires touch and consumes a significant part of your energy.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>Granting several complete Spell Lists for free would be disproportionate in RMU. The Talent is therefore retained in <strong>two Tiers</strong> as targeted innate healing abilities, defined with the GM from Blood, Bone, Muscle/Tendon/Ligament, and Cleansing healing effects. Healing requires touch and must retain a meaningful cost or usage limitation. Tier II represents substantially greater power and assumes birth in Aman or an equivalent justification.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Talents — Culturels"],"en":["Talents — Cultural"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["talents-cultural"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Racial","name":"Aura of Aman","cost":"20/Tier","tier":0,"maxTier":2,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Aura of Aman</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>A healing blessing linked to the Undying Lands runs through your lineage. The first Tier represents a character with one or two parents born in Aman and grants limited innate healing abilities. The second Tier concerns a character personally born in Aman and greatly strengthens these abilities. Healing requires touch and consumes a significant part of your energy.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>Granting several complete Spell Lists for free would be disproportionate in RMU. The Talent is therefore retained in <strong>two Tiers</strong> as targeted innate healing abilities, defined with the GM from Blood, Bone, Muscle/Tendon/Ligament, and Cleansing healing effects. Healing requires touch and must retain a meaningful cost or usage limitation. Tier II represents substantially greater power and assumes birth in Aman or an equivalent justification.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_aura-of-aman.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"R5JkxsBTftyncKWW"}
{"name":"Battle Confusion","type":"talent","img":"icons/magic/movement/abstract-ribbons-red-orange.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"battle-confusion","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"flaw","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"battle-confusion","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"flaws-mental","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Confusion au combat (Battle Confusion)","system":{"description":"<h1>Confusion au combat (Battle Confusion)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Le tumulte du combat vous désoriente. Lorsque plusieurs menaces, cris, mouvements et décisions urgentes se superposent, vous éprouvez davantage de difficulté à choisir la bonne action et à conserver une vision claire de la situation.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Le MJ peut imposer un modificateur défavorable aux jets tactiques, de Perception de combat ou d’Initiative lorsque le personnage est plongé dans un affrontement réellement chaotique. Le Défaut ne s’applique pas à toute action martiale isolée.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Battle Confusion","system":{"description":"<h1>Battle Confusion</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>The turmoil of battle disorients you. When multiple threats, cries, movements, and urgent decisions overlap, you have greater difficulty choosing the right action and maintaining a clear view of the situation.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The GM may impose an unfavorable modifier on tactical, combat Perception, or Initiative rolls when the character is caught in a genuinely chaotic confrontation. The Flaw does not apply to every isolated martial action.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Défauts — Mentaux"],"en":["Flaws — Mental"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["flaws-mental"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Discipline","name":"Battle Confusion","cost":"-10","tier":0,"maxTier":1,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Battle Confusion</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>The turmoil of battle disorients you. When multiple threats, cries, movements, and urgent decisions overlap, you have greater difficulty choosing the right action and maintaining a clear view of the situation.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The GM may impose an unfavorable modifier on tactical, combat Perception, or Initiative rolls when the character is caught in a genuinely chaotic confrontation. The Flaw does not apply to every isolated martial action.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_battle-confusion.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"U789aDyg4eCgbwsX"}
{"name":"Battle Cry","type":"talent","img":"icons/skills/movement/ball-spinning-blue.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"battle-cry","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"talent","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":3,"compendiumSourceKey":"battle-cry","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"talents-general","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Cri de guerre (Battle Cry)","system":{"description":"<h1>Cri de guerre (Battle Cry)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous savez libérer au moment décisif un cri de guerre capable de galvaniser votre agressivité et votre défense. Une fois par jour, au début d’un affrontement ou lorsque vous entrez réellement dans la mêlée, vous pouvez dépenser <strong>1 PA</strong> pour pousser ce cri.</p><p>Vous gagnez alors <strong>+5 OB</strong> et <strong>+5 DB</strong> pendant <strong>3 rounds</strong>.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Le bonus originel, qui durait pendant tout le combat, a été réduit et limité dans le temps afin de respecter l’économie en PA et l’échelle de bonus de RMU.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Battle Cry","system":{"description":"<h1>Battle Cry</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>At the decisive moment, you can unleash a war cry that galvanizes your aggression and defense. Once per day, at the beginning of a confrontation or when you truly enter the melee, you may spend <strong>1 AP</strong> to give this cry.</p><p>You then gain <strong>+5 OB</strong> and <strong>+5 DB</strong> for <strong>3 rounds</strong>.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The original bonus, which lasted for the entire combat, has been reduced and limited in duration to respect RMU’s AP economy and bonus scale.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Talents — Généraux"],"en":["Talents — General"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["talents-general"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Combat","name":"Battle Cry","cost":"10","tier":0,"maxTier":1,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Battle Cry</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>At the decisive moment, you can unleash a war cry that galvanizes your aggression and defense. Once per day, at the beginning of a confrontation or when you truly enter the melee, you may spend <strong>1 AP</strong> to give this cry.</p><p>You then gain <strong>+5 OB</strong> and <strong>+5 DB</strong> for <strong>3 rounds</strong>.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The original bonus, which lasted for the entire combat, has been reduced and limited in duration to respect RMU’s AP economy and bonus scale.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_battle-cry.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"WN6FuvCyv3ge6X3u"}
{"name":"Beardless","type":"talent","img":"icons/magic/movement/abstract-ribbons-red-orange.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"beardless","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"flaw","restrictions":{"races":["Khazâd","Naugrim"]},"descriptionVersion":3,"compendiumSourceKey":"beardless","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"flaws-physical","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Imberbe (Beardless)","system":{"description":"<h1>Imberbe (Beardless)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous êtes né sans barbe, fait exceptionnel et socialement embarrassant chez les Khazâd. Certains de vos semblables vous regardent avec pitié, embarras ou condescendance, et peuvent modifier leur comportement à votre égard.</p><p>Vous subissez <strong>−10 aux Manœuvres sociales</strong> lorsque votre apparence et le respect des conventions traditionnelles naines sont déterminants, particulièrement lors d’une première rencontre avec des Khazâd conservateurs. Cette pénalité ne s’applique pas aux personnes qui vous connaissent déjà ou qui accordent peu d’importance à cette convention.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Beardless","system":{"description":"<h1>Beardless</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You were born without a beard, an exceptional and socially embarrassing condition among the Khazâd. Some of your people regard you with pity, discomfort, or condescension and may alter their behavior toward you.</p><p>You suffer <strong>−10 to social Maneuvers</strong> when your appearance and adherence to traditional Dwarven conventions are decisive, especially on a first meeting with conservative Khazâd. This penalty does not apply to people who already know you or who place little importance on this convention.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Défauts — Physiques"],"en":["Flaws — Physical"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["flaws-physical"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Other","name":"Beardless","cost":"-5","tier":0,"maxTier":1,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Beardless</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You were born without a beard, an exceptional and socially embarrassing condition among the Khazâd. Some of your people regard you with pity, discomfort, or condescension and may alter their behavior toward you.</p><p>You suffer <strong>−10 to social Maneuvers</strong> when your appearance and adherence to traditional Dwarven conventions are decisive, especially on a first meeting with conservative Khazâd. This penalty does not apply to people who already know you or who place little importance on this convention.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_beardless.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"6BYTyvTfRon5PS0Y"}
{"name":"Bred for Carnage","type":"talent","img":"icons/skills/movement/ball-spinning-blue.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"bred-for-carnage","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"talent","restrictions":{"cultures":["Uruk-hai","Uruk Hai","Uruk"]},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"bred-for-carnage","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"talents-cultural","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Élevé pour le Carnage (Bred for Carnage)","system":{"description":"<h1>Élevé pour le Carnage (Bred for Carnage)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous avez été façonné pour continuer à tuer lorsque la frénésie s’empare de vous. Lorsque vous entrez en <strong>Frenzy</strong>, votre agressivité et votre capacité à continuer le combat augmentent encore, sans multiplier directement les dégâts infligés.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Le triplement des dégâts est supprimé. Tant que vous êtes en <strong>Frenzy</strong>, vous gagnez <strong>+5 OB</strong>, <strong>+5 Initiative</strong>, <strong>+10</strong> aux Manœuvres ou Jets de Résistance destinés à rester conscient ou à continuer à combattre malgré vos blessures, et vous ignorez <strong>5 points supplémentaires de pénalités de blessure</strong>.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Bred for Carnage","system":{"description":"<h1>Bred for Carnage</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You were shaped to keep killing when frenzy takes hold of you. When you enter <strong>Frenzy</strong>, your aggression and ability to continue fighting increase further without directly multiplying the damage you inflict.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>Tripling damage is removed. While you are in <strong>Frenzy</strong>, you gain <strong>+5 OB</strong>, <strong>+5 Initiative</strong>, <strong>+10</strong> to Maneuvers or Resistance Rolls made to remain conscious or continue fighting despite your injuries, and you ignore an <strong>additional 5 points of injury penalties</strong>.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Talents — Culturels"],"en":["Talents — Cultural"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["talents-cultural"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Combat","name":"Bred for Carnage","cost":"15","tier":0,"maxTier":1,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Bred for Carnage</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You were shaped to keep killing when frenzy takes hold of you. When you enter <strong>Frenzy</strong>, your aggression and ability to continue fighting increase further without directly multiplying the damage you inflict.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>Tripling damage is removed. While you are in <strong>Frenzy</strong>, you gain <strong>+5 OB</strong>, <strong>+5 Initiative</strong>, <strong>+10</strong> to Maneuvers or Resistance Rolls made to remain conscious or continue fighting despite your injuries, and you ignore an <strong>additional 5 points of injury penalties</strong>.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_bred-for-carnage.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"lSIEQt12NJor5a8C"}
{"name":"Bred for War","type":"talent","img":"icons/skills/movement/ball-spinning-blue.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"bred-for-war","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"talent","restrictions":{"cultures":["Uruk-hai","Uruk Hai","Uruk"]},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"bred-for-war","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"talents-cultural","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Élevé pour la Guerre (Bred for War)","system":{"description":"<h1>Élevé pour la Guerre (Bred for War)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous avez été élevé — et peut-être sélectionné — pour la guerre. La source décrit un Uruk-hai massif, brutalement robuste, dont la Force, la Constitution et le Développement Corporel dépassent ceux de ses semblables.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>En MERP-RMU, les bonus sont ramenés à l’échelle de RMU : <strong>+1 au bonus de Force</strong>, <strong>+1 au bonus de Constitution</strong> et <strong>+5 à Développement Corporel (Body Development)</strong>. Ce Talent est réservé aux origines pour lesquelles un tel élevage guerrier est cohérent.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Bred for War","system":{"description":"<h1>Bred for War</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You were raised—and perhaps selected—for war. The source describes a massive, brutally robust Uruk-hai whose Strength, Constitution, and Body Development exceed those of its fellows.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>In MERP-RMU, the bonuses are reduced to the RMU scale: <strong>+1 to the Strength bonus</strong>, <strong>+1 to the Constitution bonus</strong>, and <strong>+5 to Body Development</strong>. This Talent is restricted to origins for which such martial breeding is appropriate.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Talents — Culturels"],"en":["Talents — Cultural"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["talents-cultural"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Racial","name":"Bred for War","cost":"15","tier":0,"maxTier":1,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Bred for War</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You were raised—and perhaps selected—for war. The source describes a massive, brutally robust Uruk-hai whose Strength, Constitution, and Body Development exceed those of its fellows.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>In MERP-RMU, the bonuses are reduced to the RMU scale: <strong>+1 to the Strength bonus</strong>, <strong>+1 to the Constitution bonus</strong>, and <strong>+5 to Body Development</strong>. This Talent is restricted to origins for which such martial breeding is appropriate.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_bred-for-war.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"cw9baC1SmR70XvRU"}
{"name":"Calmness","type":"talent","img":"icons/skills/movement/ball-spinning-blue.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"calmness","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"talent","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"calmness","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"talents-mental","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Calme (Calmness)","system":{"description":"<h1>Calme (Calmness)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous conservez votre sang-froid lorsque la pression monte. Votre calme améliore les interactions sociales entreprises dans une situation tendue : commandement, diplomatie, prise de parole, séduction et autres tentatives où la maîtrise de soi fait la différence.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Vous gagnez <strong>+5 par Tier</strong> aux Manœuvres Sociales ou de Discipline lorsque le fait de rester calme sous pression est directement déterminant. Le bonus ne s’applique pas aux interactions ordinaires dépourvues de tension réelle.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Calmness","system":{"description":"<h1>Calmness</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You keep your composure when pressure rises. Your calm improves social interactions undertaken in tense situations: leadership, diplomacy, public speaking, seduction, and other attempts where self-control makes the difference.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>You gain <strong>+5 per Tier</strong> to Social or Discipline Maneuvers when remaining calm under pressure is directly decisive. The bonus does not apply to ordinary interactions lacking genuine tension.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Talents — Mentaux"],"en":["Talents — Mental"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["talents-mental"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Discipline","name":"Calmness","cost":"5/Tier","tier":0,"maxTier":3,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Calmness</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You keep your composure when pressure rises. Your calm improves social interactions undertaken in tense situations: leadership, diplomacy, public speaking, seduction, and other attempts where self-control makes the difference.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>You gain <strong>+5 per Tier</strong> to Social or Discipline Maneuvers when remaining calm under pressure is directly decisive. The bonus does not apply to ordinary interactions lacking genuine tension.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_calmness.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"b8qGWu3S9rmoJjBg"}
{"name":"Code of Honour","type":"talent","img":"icons/magic/movement/abstract-ribbons-red-orange.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"code-of-honour","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"flaw","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"code-of-honour","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"flaws-mental","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Code d’honneur (Code of Honour)","system":{"description":"<h1>Code d’honneur (Code of Honour)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous adhérez à un code moral, guerrier, religieux ou social qui limite réellement vos choix. Le code doit comporter des obligations suffisamment précises pour pouvoir vous contraindre même lorsqu’il serait plus avantageux de les ignorer.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Le code est défini avec le MJ à l’acquisition. Le personnage doit le respecter tant qu’il possède le Défaut ; une violation volontaire doit entraîner des conséquences narratives et, si nécessaire, mécaniques proportionnées à son importance.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Code of Honour","system":{"description":"<h1>Code of Honour</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You adhere to a moral, martial, religious, or social code that genuinely restricts your choices. The code must contain obligations precise enough to constrain you even when ignoring them would be more advantageous.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The code is defined with the GM when the Flaw is acquired. The character must honor it while possessing the Flaw; a deliberate violation should bring narrative and, where appropriate, mechanical consequences proportionate to its importance.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Défauts — Mentaux"],"en":["Flaws — Mental"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["flaws-mental"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Other","name":"Code of Honour","cost":"-10","tier":0,"maxTier":1,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Code of Honour</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You adhere to a moral, martial, religious, or social code that genuinely restricts your choices. The code must contain obligations precise enough to constrain you even when ignoring them would be more advantageous.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The code is defined with the GM when the Flaw is acquired. The character must honor it while possessing the Flaw; a deliberate violation should bring narrative and, where appropriate, mechanical consequences proportionate to its importance.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_code-of-honour.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"Z2NpnkdEcesLZ73t"}
{"name":"Crippled","type":"talent","img":"icons/magic/movement/abstract-ribbons-red-orange.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"crippled","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"flaw","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"crippled","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"flaws-physical","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Infirmité (Crippled)","system":{"description":"<h1>Infirmité (Crippled)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Une jambe est gravement diminuée ou absente. Les trois Tiers vont d’une mobilité fortement réduite à la perte fonctionnelle d’une jambe, puis des deux jambes, avec des conséquences croissantes sur le déplacement et le combat.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><ul><li><strong>Tier I :</strong> une jambe reste utilisable mais la mobilité est fortement diminuée.</li><li><strong>Tier II :</strong> une jambe est perdue ou totalement inutilisable ; une aide ou une prothèse est nécessaire.</li><li><strong>Tier III :</strong> les deux jambes sont perdues ou inutilisables ; un moyen de mobilité externe est indispensable.</li></ul><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Les anciennes réductions fixes de Base Movement Rate et d’OB sont remplacées par les règles RMU de mouvement, d’Allure et de pénalités adaptées à l’état du personnage. Le handicap doit rester mécaniquement significatif au niveau correspondant.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Crippled","system":{"description":"<h1>Crippled</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>One leg is severely impaired or absent. The three Tiers range from greatly reduced mobility to the functional loss of one leg, then both legs, with increasing consequences for movement and combat.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><ul><li><strong>Tier I:</strong> one leg remains usable, but mobility is greatly reduced.</li><li><strong>Tier II:</strong> one leg is lost or completely unusable; assistance or a prosthesis is required.</li><li><strong>Tier III:</strong> both legs are lost or unusable; an external means of mobility is essential.</li></ul><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The old fixed reductions to Base Movement Rate and OB are replaced by RMU movement, Pace, and penalty rules appropriate to the character’s condition. The disability must remain mechanically significant at the corresponding level.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Défauts — Physiques"],"en":["Flaws — Physical"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["flaws-physical"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Physical","name":"Crippled","cost":"-10/Tier","tier":0,"maxTier":3,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Crippled</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>One leg is severely impaired or absent. The three Tiers range from greatly reduced mobility to the functional loss of one leg, then both legs, with increasing consequences for movement and combat.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><ul><li><strong>Tier I:</strong> one leg remains usable, but mobility is greatly reduced.</li><li><strong>Tier II:</strong> one leg is lost or completely unusable; assistance or a prosthesis is required.</li><li><strong>Tier III:</strong> both legs are lost or unusable; an external means of mobility is essential.</li></ul><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The old fixed reductions to Base Movement Rate and OB are replaced by RMU movement, Pace, and penalty rules appropriate to the character’s condition. The disability must remain mechanically significant at the corresponding level.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_crippled.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"ndhiNTdiWu6BH01g"}
{"name":"Danger Sense","type":"talent","img":"icons/skills/movement/ball-spinning-blue.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"danger-sense","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"talent","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"danger-sense","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"talents-mystical","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Sens du danger (Danger Sense)","system":{"description":"<h1>Sens du danger (Danger Sense)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous possédez une intuition surnaturelle qui vous avertit lorsqu’un danger immédiat vous menace. Cette sensation ne révèle pas nécessairement la nature, la direction ou l’auteur du danger : elle peut n’être qu’un malaise, une certitude soudaine ou l’impression que quelque chose ne va pas.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Ce Talent demeure distinct de <em>Destiny Sense</em>. Lorsqu’un péril réel et imminent devrait pouvoir être pressenti, le MJ peut effectuer secrètement une Manœuvre appropriée ou fournir un avertissement proportionné à la situation. Le Talent ne remplace ni Perception ni les capacités de détection spécialisées.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Danger Sense","system":{"description":"<h1>Danger Sense</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You possess a supernatural intuition that warns you when immediate danger threatens you. This sensation does not necessarily reveal the nature, direction, or source of the danger: it may be nothing more than unease, a sudden certainty, or the feeling that something is wrong.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>This Talent remains distinct from <em>Destiny Sense</em>. When a real and imminent peril could reasonably be sensed, the GM may secretly make an appropriate Maneuver or provide a warning proportionate to the situation. The Talent replaces neither Perception nor specialized detection abilities.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Talents — Mystiques"],"en":["Talents — Mystical"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["talents-mystical"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Senses","name":"Danger Sense","cost":"10","tier":0,"maxTier":1,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Danger Sense</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You possess a supernatural intuition that warns you when immediate danger threatens you. This sensation does not necessarily reveal the nature, direction, or source of the danger: it may be nothing more than unease, a sudden certainty, or the feeling that something is wrong.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>This Talent remains distinct from <em>Destiny Sense</em>. When a real and imminent peril could reasonably be sensed, the GM may secretly make an appropriate Maneuver or provide a warning proportionate to the situation. The Talent replaces neither Perception nor specialized detection abilities.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_danger-sense.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"BdIb7RTz0fP29Qkc"}
{"name":"Dependent","type":"talent","img":"icons/magic/movement/abstract-ribbons-red-orange.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"dependent","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"flaw","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"dependent","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"flaws-special","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Personne à charge (Dependent)","system":{"description":"<h1>Personne à charge (Dependent)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Une personne ou un petit groupe dépend concrètement de vous pour sa sécurité, son entretien, sa protection ou sa survie. Cette relation crée une responsabilité exploitable en jeu et peut vous contraindre à consacrer temps, ressources ou risques à autrui.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><p>Avec les Tiers supérieurs, la personne à charge devient plus vulnérable, plus exigeante, plus exposée au danger ou plus difficile à protéger.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Le MJ et le joueur définissent clairement qui dépend du personnage et pourquoi. La relation doit être réelle dans la campagne et ne peut pas rester constamment hors scène.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Dependent","system":{"description":"<h1>Dependent</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>A person or small group concretely depends on you for safety, support, protection, or survival. This relationship creates a responsibility that can matter in play and may force you to devote time, resources, or risk to others.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><p>At higher Tiers, the dependent becomes more vulnerable, more demanding, more exposed to danger, or more difficult to protect.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The GM and player clearly define who depends on the character and why. The relationship must be real within the campaign and cannot remain permanently offstage.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Défauts — Spéciaux"],"en":["Flaws — Special"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["flaws-special"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Other","name":"Dependent","cost":"-5/Tier","tier":0,"maxTier":3,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Dependent</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>A person or small group concretely depends on you for safety, support, protection, or survival. This relationship creates a responsibility that can matter in play and may force you to devote time, resources, or risk to others.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><p>At higher Tiers, the dependent becomes more vulnerable, more demanding, more exposed to danger, or more difficult to protect.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The GM and player clearly define who depends on the character and why. The relationship must be real within the campaign and cannot remain permanently offstage.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_dependent.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"vJakOuFunkpDptAM"}
{"name":"Dúnedain Ancestry","type":"talent","img":"icons/skills/movement/ball-spinning-blue.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"dunedain-ancestry","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"talent","restrictions":{"cultures":["Eriadoriens","Eriadorian"]},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"dunedain-ancestry","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"talents-cultural","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Ascendance dúnadan (Dúnedain Ancestry)","system":{"description":"<h1>Ascendance dúnadan (Dúnedain Ancestry)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Un de vos ancêtres appartenait aux Dúnedain et une partie de cet héritage demeure dans votre lignée. Les trois Tiers augmentent progressivement votre longévité et votre résistance aux maladies ; aux Tiers supérieurs, votre héritage dúnadan renforce aussi votre développement corporel et certaines de vos caractéristiques physiques et spirituelles.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><ul><li><strong>Tier I :</strong> votre longévité est sensiblement supérieure à celle d’un Humain ordinaire.</li><li><strong>Tier II :</strong> vous gagnez en plus <strong>+5 aux Jets de Résistance contre les maladies</strong>.</li><li><strong>Tier III :</strong> vous gagnez également <strong>+1 aux bonus de Force, Constitution et Présence</strong>.</li></ul><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>L’ancienne progression fixe de Body Development n’est pas transposée, car RMU calcule le Développement Corporel différemment. Les trois Tiers conservent l’idée d’un héritage dúnadan de plus en plus marqué.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Dúnedain Ancestry","system":{"description":"<h1>Dúnedain Ancestry</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>One of your ancestors belonged to the Dúnedain, and part of that heritage remains in your bloodline. The three Tiers progressively increase your longevity and resistance to disease; at higher Tiers, your Dúnedain heritage also strengthens your physical development and certain physical and spiritual characteristics.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><ul><li><strong>Tier I:</strong> your lifespan is noticeably greater than that of an ordinary Man.</li><li><strong>Tier II:</strong> you also gain <strong>+5 to Resistance Rolls against disease</strong>.</li><li><strong>Tier III:</strong> you additionally gain <strong>+1 to your Strength, Constitution, and Presence bonuses</strong>.</li></ul><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The old fixed Body Development progression is not carried over because RMU calculates Body Development differently. The three Tiers preserve the idea of an increasingly pronounced Dúnedain heritage.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Talents — Culturels"],"en":["Talents — Cultural"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["talents-cultural"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Racial","name":"Dúnedain Ancestry","cost":"7/Tier","tier":0,"maxTier":3,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Dúnedain Ancestry</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>One of your ancestors belonged to the Dúnedain, and part of that heritage remains in your bloodline. The three Tiers progressively increase your longevity and resistance to disease; at higher Tiers, your Dúnedain heritage also strengthens your physical development and certain physical and spiritual characteristics.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><ul><li><strong>Tier I:</strong> your lifespan is noticeably greater than that of an ordinary Man.</li><li><strong>Tier II:</strong> you also gain <strong>+5 to Resistance Rolls against disease</strong>.</li><li><strong>Tier III:</strong> you additionally gain <strong>+1 to your Strength, Constitution, and Presence bonuses</strong>.</li></ul><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The old fixed Body Development progression is not carried over because RMU calculates Body Development differently. The three Tiers preserve the idea of an increasingly pronounced Dúnedain heritage.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_dunedain-ancestry.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"07XNIwmclEhFJ5aB"}
{"name":"Disease Resistance","type":"talent","img":"icons/skills/movement/ball-spinning-blue.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"dunedain-disease-resistance","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"MERP-RMU","kind":"talent","restrictions":{"races":["Dúnedain"]},"descriptionVersion":1,"compendiumSourceKey":"dunedain-disease-resistance","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"talents-cultural","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Résistance aux maladies","system":{"description":"<h1>Résistance aux maladies</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Les Dúnedain sont moins vulnérables que les Hommes communs aux maladies naturelles et aux affections liées aux privations.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Ce Talent racial représente cette résistance héréditaire. Il est accordé par la Race et n’est pas destiné à être acheté séparément lors du développement normal du personnage.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Disease Resistance","system":{"description":"<h1>Disease Resistance</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>The Dúnedain are less vulnerable than Common Men to natural diseases and afflictions caused by deprivation.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>This racial Talent represents that inherited resistance. It is granted by the Race and is not intended to be purchased separately during normal character development.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Talents — Culturels"],"en":["Talents — Cultural"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["talents-cultural"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Racial","name":"Résistance aux maladies","cost":"0","tier":0,"maxTier":1,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Disease Resistance</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>The Dúnedain are less vulnerable than Common Men to natural diseases and afflictions caused by deprivation.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>This racial Talent represents that inherited resistance. It is granted by the Race and is not intended to be purchased separately during normal character development.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_dunedain-disease-resistance.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"AQ1ouJPGDxTetFfc"}
{"name":"Dúnedain Longevity","type":"talent","img":"icons/skills/movement/ball-spinning-blue.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"dunedain-longevity","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"MERP-RMU","kind":"talent","restrictions":{"races":["Dúnedain"]},"descriptionVersion":1,"compendiumSourceKey":"dunedain-longevity","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"talents-cultural","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Longévité dúnadan","system":{"description":"<h1>Longévité dúnadan</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Les Dúnedain de sang relativement pur vivent généralement entre <strong>160 et 240 ans</strong> et conservent longtemps leur vigueur.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Ce Talent racial représente la longévité propre aux Dúnedain. Il est accordé par la Race et n’est pas destiné à être acheté séparément lors du développement normal du personnage.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Dúnedain Longevity","system":{"description":"<h1>Dúnedain Longevity</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Dúnedain of relatively pure blood generally live between <strong>160 and 240 years</strong> and retain their vigor for a long time.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>This racial Talent represents the longevity inherent to the Dúnedain. It is granted by the Race and is not intended to be purchased separately during normal character development.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Talents — Culturels"],"en":["Talents — Cultural"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["talents-cultural"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Racial","name":"Longévité dúnadan","cost":"0","tier":0,"maxTier":1,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Dúnedain Longevity</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Dúnedain of relatively pure blood generally live between <strong>160 and 240 years</strong> and retain their vigor for a long time.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>This racial Talent represents the longevity inherent to the Dúnedain. It is granted by the Race and is not intended to be purchased separately during normal character development.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_dunedain-longevity.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"MHJ3ZNBWbpLhyDMK"}
{"name":"Western Endurance","type":"talent","img":"icons/skills/movement/ball-spinning-blue.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"dunedain-western-endurance","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"MERP-RMU","kind":"talent","restrictions":{"races":["Dúnedain"]},"descriptionVersion":1,"compendiumSourceKey":"dunedain-western-endurance","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"talents-cultural","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Endurance de l’Ouest","system":{"description":"<h1>Endurance de l’Ouest</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>La constitution et la discipline héritées de l’Ouest permettent aux Dúnedain de soutenir de longues marches, des veilles prolongées et des efforts difficiles.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Ce Talent racial représente l’endurance propre aux héritiers de Númenor. Il est accordé par la Race et n’est pas destiné à être acheté séparément lors du développement normal du personnage.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Western Endurance","system":{"description":"<h1>Western Endurance</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>The constitution and discipline inherited from the West allow the Dúnedain to sustain long marches, prolonged watches, and arduous efforts.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>This racial Talent represents the endurance of the heirs of Númenor. It is granted by the Race and is not intended to be purchased separately during normal character development.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Talents — Culturels"],"en":["Talents — Cultural"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["talents-cultural"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Racial","name":"Endurance de l’Ouest","cost":"0","tier":0,"maxTier":1,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Western Endurance</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>The constitution and discipline inherited from the West allow the Dúnedain to sustain long marches, prolonged watches, and arduous efforts.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>This racial Talent represents the endurance of the heirs of Númenor. It is granted by the Race and is not intended to be purchased separately during normal character development.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_dunedain-western-endurance.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"UevcrSCmHVWOtsyK"}
{"name":"Duty","type":"talent","img":"icons/magic/movement/abstract-ribbons-red-orange.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"duty","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"flaw","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"duty","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"flaws-special","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Devoir (Duty)","system":{"description":"<h1>Devoir (Duty)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous êtes lié par une obligation externe : service militaire, charge politique, ordre religieux, fonction administrative, dette féodale ou autre engagement institutionnel. Contrairement au <em>Sens du devoir</em>, cette contrainte vient d’une autorité ou d’un statut extérieur.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><ul><li><strong>Tier I :</strong> convocations ou obligations occasionnelles.</li><li><strong>Tier II :</strong> devoirs fréquents et difficiles à éviter.</li><li><strong>Tier III :</strong> l’autorité peut vous requérir très souvent et les conséquences d’un refus sont importantes.</li></ul><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Plus le Tier est élevé, plus votre autorité de tutelle ou votre fonction vous réclame fréquemment et plus les conséquences d’un refus sont graves. Le MJ utilise cette contrainte comme une fréquence narrative plutôt que comme un jet systématique obligatoire.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Duty","system":{"description":"<h1>Duty</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You are bound by an external obligation: military service, political office, religious order, administrative function, feudal debt, or another institutional commitment. Unlike <em>Sense of Duty</em>, this constraint comes from an outside authority or status.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><ul><li><strong>Tier I:</strong> occasional summons or obligations.</li><li><strong>Tier II:</strong> frequent duties that are difficult to avoid.</li><li><strong>Tier III:</strong> the authority may call on you very often and the consequences of refusal are significant.</li></ul><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The higher the Tier, the more frequently your supervising authority or office calls on you and the more serious the consequences of refusal. The GM uses this constraint as a narrative frequency rather than as a mandatory systematic roll.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Défauts — Spéciaux"],"en":["Flaws — Special"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["flaws-special"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Other","name":"Duty","cost":"-5/Tier","tier":0,"maxTier":3,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Duty</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You are bound by an external obligation: military service, political office, religious order, administrative function, feudal debt, or another institutional commitment. Unlike <em>Sense of Duty</em>, this constraint comes from an outside authority or status.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><ul><li><strong>Tier I:</strong> occasional summons or obligations.</li><li><strong>Tier II:</strong> frequent duties that are difficult to avoid.</li><li><strong>Tier III:</strong> the authority may call on you very often and the consequences of refusal are significant.</li></ul><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The higher the Tier, the more frequently your supervising authority or office calls on you and the more serious the consequences of refusal. The GM uses this constraint as a narrative frequency rather than as a mandatory systematic roll.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_duty.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"tYq1XbPT3WTqu9yJ"}
{"name":"Dwarf Friend","type":"talent","img":"icons/skills/movement/ball-spinning-blue.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"dwarf-friend","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"talent","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"dwarf-friend","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"talents-cultural","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Ami des Nains (Dwarf Friend)","system":{"description":"<h1>Ami des Nains (Dwarf Friend)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous connaissez suffisamment les Khazâd et leurs usages pour avoir gagné une réputation favorable auprès d’eux. Les Nains que vous rencontrez vous accordent plus volontiers leur respect ; cette relation s’accompagne aussi d’une meilleure connaissance de leur culture.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Le MJ peut accorder <strong>+5</strong> aux interactions sociales avec des Khazâd lorsque cette réputation ou cette familiarité culturelle est pertinente. Le Talent justifie également une connaissance réelle des coutumes naines, sans remplacer les rangs de Connaissance des Races ou de Culture nécessaires aux informations spécialisées.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Dwarf Friend","system":{"description":"<h1>Dwarf Friend</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You know enough about the Khazâd and their customs to have earned a favorable reputation among them. Dwarves you meet are more inclined to grant you their respect, and this relationship is accompanied by a better understanding of their culture.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The GM may grant <strong>+5</strong> to social interactions with Khazâd when this reputation or cultural familiarity is relevant. The Talent also justifies genuine knowledge of Dwarven customs without replacing the Race Lore or Culture ranks required for specialized information.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Talents — Culturels"],"en":["Talents — Cultural"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["talents-cultural"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Other","name":"Dwarf Friend","cost":"10","tier":0,"maxTier":1,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Dwarf Friend</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You know enough about the Khazâd and their customs to have earned a favorable reputation among them. Dwarves you meet are more inclined to grant you their respect, and this relationship is accompanied by a better understanding of their culture.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The GM may grant <strong>+5</strong> to social interactions with Khazâd when this reputation or cultural familiarity is relevant. The Talent also justifies genuine knowledge of Dwarven customs without replacing the Race Lore or Culture ranks required for specialized information.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_dwarf-friend.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"KhpfNhsRbsKambja"}
{"name":"Dwarf Sense","type":"talent","img":"icons/skills/movement/ball-spinning-blue.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"dwarf-sense","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"talent","restrictions":{"races":["Khazâd","Naugrim","Petits-Nains"]},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"dwarf-sense","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"talents-cultural","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Sens des Nains (Dwarf Sense)","system":{"description":"<h1>Sens des Nains (Dwarf Sense)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous possédez l’orientation souterraine instinctive traditionnellement attribuée aux Khazâd. Sous terre, vous pouvez presque naturellement déterminer votre orientation générale et évaluer l’élévation ou la profondeur relative de votre position.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Comme RMU possède déjà <em>Direction Sense</em>, le Talent ne duplique pas son effet principal. Sous terre, vous pouvez évaluer avec une grande fiabilité <strong>pente, élévation et profondeur relative</strong>, et le MJ peut vous fournir spontanément ces informations lorsqu’elles sont perceptibles par cette faculté.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Dwarf Sense","system":{"description":"<h1>Dwarf Sense</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You possess the instinctive underground orientation traditionally attributed to the Khazâd. Underground, you can almost naturally determine your general direction and assess the relative elevation or depth of your position.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>Because RMU already has <em>Direction Sense</em>, this Talent does not duplicate its main effect. Underground, you can assess <strong>slope, elevation, and relative depth</strong> with great reliability, and the GM may provide this information spontaneously whenever it can be perceived through this faculty.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Talents — Culturels"],"en":["Talents — Cultural"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["talents-cultural"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Racial","name":"Dwarf Sense","cost":"5","tier":0,"maxTier":1,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Dwarf Sense</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You possess the instinctive underground orientation traditionally attributed to the Khazâd. Underground, you can almost naturally determine your general direction and assess the relative elevation or depth of your position.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>Because RMU already has <em>Direction Sense</em>, this Talent does not duplicate its main effect. Underground, you can assess <strong>slope, elevation, and relative depth</strong> with great reliability, and the GM may provide this information spontaneously whenever it can be perceived through this faculty.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_dwarf-sense.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"G6OZubiwxGOVMIBX"}
{"name":"Elf Friend","type":"talent","img":"icons/skills/movement/ball-spinning-blue.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"elf-friend","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"talent","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"elf-friend","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"talents-cultural","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Ami des Elfes (Elf Friend)","system":{"description":"<h1>Ami des Elfes (Elf Friend)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous connaissez les Elfes et avez gagné leur estime. Cette relation favorable améliore vos interactions avec eux et s’accompagne de connaissances sur une culture elfique ainsi que d’une meilleure maîtrise d’une éventuelle langue elfique apprise.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Le MJ peut accorder <strong>+5</strong> aux interactions sociales avec des Elfes lorsque cette réputation est pertinente. Le Talent justifie une familiarité culturelle et linguistique, mais n’accorde pas à lui seul des rangs gratuits supplémentaires dans les Compétences RMU.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Elf Friend","system":{"description":"<h1>Elf Friend</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You know the Elves and have earned their esteem. This favorable relationship improves your interactions with them and is accompanied by knowledge of an Elven culture and greater fluency in any Elven language you have learned.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The GM may grant <strong>+5</strong> to social interactions with Elves when this reputation is relevant. The Talent justifies cultural and linguistic familiarity but does not by itself grant additional free ranks in RMU Skills.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Talents — Culturels"],"en":["Talents — Cultural"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["talents-cultural"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Other","name":"Elf Friend","cost":"12","tier":0,"maxTier":1,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Elf Friend</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You know the Elves and have earned their esteem. This favorable relationship improves your interactions with them and is accompanied by knowledge of an Elven culture and greater fluency in any Elven language you have learned.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The GM may grant <strong>+5</strong> to social interactions with Elves when this reputation is relevant. The Talent justifies cultural and linguistic familiarity but does not by itself grant additional free ranks in RMU Skills.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_elf-friend.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"yFlqaY6nT2psAuXg"}
{"name":"Elf-Hater","type":"talent","img":"icons/skills/movement/ball-spinning-blue.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"elf-hater","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"talent","restrictions":{"cultures":["Uruk-hai","Uruk Hai","Uruk"]},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"elf-hater","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"talents-cultural","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Haine des Elfes (Elf-Hater)","system":{"description":"<h1>Haine des Elfes (Elf-Hater)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>La haine des Elfes, déjà forte chez beaucoup d’Orcs, devient chez vous une rage presque incontrôlable. Face aux Elfes, cette haine augmente votre agressivité, votre efficacité offensive et votre capacité à poursuivre le combat, mais elle vous pousse à privilégier l’attaque au détriment de la prudence.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>La version MERP-RMU est volontairement réduite : contre un adversaire elfe, vous gagnez <strong>+10 OB</strong> et <strong>+5 Initiative</strong>, et vous ignorez jusqu’à <strong>5 points de pénalités de blessure</strong> lorsque vous l’attaquez. En contrepartie, vous <strong>ne pouvez pas allouer d’OB à la parade</strong> contre un adversaire elfe. Le doublement des dégâts et l’augmentation automatique de la vitesse ont été supprimés.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Elf-Hater","system":{"description":"<h1>Elf-Hater</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>The hatred of Elves, already strong among many Orcs, becomes an almost uncontrollable rage in you. Against Elves, this hatred increases your aggression, offensive effectiveness, and ability to keep fighting, but it drives you to favor attack over caution.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The MERP-RMU version is deliberately reduced: against an Elven opponent you gain <strong>+10 OB</strong> and <strong>+5 Initiative</strong>, and ignore up to <strong>5 points of injury penalties</strong> while attacking them. In return, you <strong>cannot allocate OB to parry</strong> against an Elven opponent. Doubling damage and automatically increasing speed have been removed.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Talents — Culturels"],"en":["Talents — Cultural"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["talents-cultural"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Combat","name":"Elf-Hater","cost":"10","tier":0,"maxTier":1,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Elf-Hater</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>The hatred of Elves, already strong among many Orcs, becomes an almost uncontrollable rage in you. Against Elves, this hatred increases your aggression, offensive effectiveness, and ability to keep fighting, but it drives you to favor attack over caution.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The MERP-RMU version is deliberately reduced: against an Elven opponent you gain <strong>+10 OB</strong> and <strong>+5 Initiative</strong>, and ignore up to <strong>5 points of injury penalties</strong> while attacking them. In return, you <strong>cannot allocate OB to parry</strong> against an Elven opponent. Doubling damage and automatically increasing speed have been removed.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_elf-hater.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"BswR4EKElgRRqD0l"}
{"name":"Ensorcellment Cure","type":"talent","img":"icons/skills/movement/ball-spinning-blue.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"ensorcellment-cure","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"talent","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":3,"compendiumSourceKey":"ensorcellment-cure","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"talents-mystical","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Guérison d’envoûtement (Ensorcellment Cure)","system":{"description":"<h1>Guérison d’envoûtement (Ensorcellment Cure)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous pouvez tenter de délivrer une créature d’une altération magique permanente en la touchant : malédiction, lycanthropie, enchantement durable ou effet comparable. La puissance qui maintient l’altération doit résister à votre tentative ; en cas d’échec, l’effet est définitivement dissipé.</p><p>Si l’altération résiste, vous ne pouvez pas tenter de supprimer une nouvelle fois ce même effet avant d’avoir gagné un niveau.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>La tentative utilise le niveau du personnage comme niveau d’effet opposé à celui de la malédiction ou de l’altération. Le MJ détermine le Jet de Résistance approprié lorsque l’effet ne possède pas déjà de niveau clairement défini. Les altérations directement liées à des puissances uniques, des artefacts majeurs ou des volontés supérieures peuvent rester hors de portée de ce Talent.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Ensorcellment Cure","system":{"description":"<h1>Ensorcellment Cure</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You can attempt to free a creature from a permanent magical alteration by touching it: a curse, lycanthropy, lasting enchantment, or comparable effect. The power sustaining the alteration must resist your attempt; if it fails, the effect is permanently dispelled.</p><p>If the alteration resists, you cannot attempt to remove that same effect again until you have gained a level.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The attempt uses the character’s level as the effect level opposed to the level of the curse or alteration. The GM determines the appropriate Resistance Roll when the effect does not already have a clearly defined level. Alterations directly linked to unique powers, major artifacts, or superior wills may remain beyond the reach of this Talent.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Talents — Mystiques"],"en":["Talents — Mystical"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["talents-mystical"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Magical","name":"Ensorcellment Cure","cost":"15","tier":0,"maxTier":1,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Ensorcellment Cure</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You can attempt to free a creature from a permanent magical alteration by touching it: a curse, lycanthropy, lasting enchantment, or comparable effect. The power sustaining the alteration must resist your attempt; if it fails, the effect is permanently dispelled.</p><p>If the alteration resists, you cannot attempt to remove that same effect again until you have gained a level.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The attempt uses the character’s level as the effect level opposed to the level of the curse or alteration. The GM determines the appropriate Resistance Roll when the effect does not already have a clearly defined level. Alterations directly linked to unique powers, major artifacts, or superior wills may remain beyond the reach of this Talent.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_ensorcellment-cure.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"Q4AqWEEXEEmhq40T"}
{"name":"Epileptic","type":"talent","img":"icons/magic/movement/abstract-ribbons-red-orange.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"epileptic","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"flaw","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"epileptic","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"flaws-physical","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Épilepsie (Epileptic)","system":{"description":"<h1>Épilepsie (Epileptic)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous souffrez de crises épileptiques sévères. Une situation de stress extrême peut déclencher une crise : vous perdez momentanément la capacité de penser ou parler clairement, êtes pris de convulsions et lâchez ce que vous tenez. Une telle crise vous laisse ensuite fortement épuisé.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>En MERP-RMU, lorsqu’un stress extrême constitue un déclencheur crédible, le MJ demande un Jet de Résistance approprié. En cas d’échec, le personnage subit une crise : il est incapable d’agir normalement, lâche les objets tenus et reste sévèrement incapacitant pendant une durée déterminée par le MJ ou le jet prévu par la table de campagne. La récupération doit également entraîner une Fatigue significative.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Epileptic","system":{"description":"<h1>Epileptic</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You suffer from severe epileptic seizures. Extreme stress may trigger a seizure: you temporarily lose the ability to think or speak clearly, convulse, and drop whatever you are holding. Such a seizure leaves you severely exhausted afterward.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>In MERP-RMU, when extreme stress presents a credible trigger, the GM calls for an appropriate Resistance Roll. On a failure, the character suffers a seizure: they cannot act normally, drop held objects, and remain severely incapacitated for a duration determined by the GM or by the campaign table being used. Recovery should also cause significant Fatigue.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Défauts — Physiques"],"en":["Flaws — Physical"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["flaws-physical"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Physical","name":"Epileptic","cost":"-20","tier":0,"maxTier":1,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Epileptic</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You suffer from severe epileptic seizures. Extreme stress may trigger a seizure: you temporarily lose the ability to think or speak clearly, convulse, and drop whatever you are holding. Such a seizure leaves you severely exhausted afterward.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>In MERP-RMU, when extreme stress presents a credible trigger, the GM calls for an appropriate Resistance Roll. On a failure, the character suffers a seizure: they cannot act normally, drop held objects, and remain severely incapacitated for a duration determined by the GM or by the campaign table being used. Recovery should also cause significant Fatigue.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_epileptic.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"olB6cSMsLi5wFzLG"}
{"name":"Ethereal Sight","type":"talent","img":"icons/skills/movement/ball-spinning-blue.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"ethereal-sight","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"talent","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"ethereal-sight","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"talents-mystical","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Vue éthérée (Ethereal Sight)","system":{"description":"<h1>Vue éthérée (Ethereal Sight)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Votre perception s’étend au-delà du monde strictement matériel. Vous pouvez discerner certaines manifestations éthérées, spirituelles ou normalement invisibles aux sens ordinaires, selon leur nature et les circonstances.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Le Talent ne confère pas une vision universelle de l’invisible. Le MJ détermine quelles manifestations ont une composante éthérée perceptible et peut demander une Manœuvre de Perception lorsque l’apparition est faible, dissimulée ou ambiguë.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Ethereal Sight","system":{"description":"<h1>Ethereal Sight</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Your perception extends beyond the strictly material world. You can discern certain ethereal or spiritual manifestations, or things normally invisible to ordinary senses, according to their nature and the circumstances.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The Talent does not grant universal sight of the invisible. The GM determines which manifestations possess a perceptible ethereal component and may require a Perception Maneuver when an apparition is faint, concealed, or ambiguous.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Talents — Mystiques"],"en":["Talents — Mystical"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["talents-mystical"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Senses","name":"Ethereal Sight","cost":"10","tier":0,"maxTier":1,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Ethereal Sight</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Your perception extends beyond the strictly material world. You can discern certain ethereal or spiritual manifestations, or things normally invisible to ordinary senses, according to their nature and the circumstances.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The Talent does not grant universal sight of the invisible. The GM determines which manifestations possess a perceptible ethereal component and may require a Perception Maneuver when an apparition is faint, concealed, or ambiguous.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_ethereal-sight.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"Tjgr7hOeVMxoltZr"}
{"name":"Friendslayer","type":"talent","img":"icons/magic/movement/abstract-ribbons-red-orange.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"friendslayer","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"flaw","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":3,"compendiumSourceKey":"friendslayer","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"flaws-special","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Fratricide magique (Friendslayer)","system":{"description":"<h1>Fratricide magique (Friendslayer)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vos échecs avec les sorts offensifs mettent parfois vos propres alliés en danger. Lorsque vous échouez à lancer un sort d’attaque et qu’un allié constitue une cible valide dans la portée du sort, le MJ choisit aléatoirement l’un de ces alliés : le sort se retourne contre lui au lieu d’être résolu comme un échec ordinaire.</p><p>La nouvelle cible bénéficie de toutes les défenses et de tous les Jets de Résistance auxquels elle aurait normalement droit. S’il n’existe aucun allié valide à portée, l’échec est résolu normalement.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Le déclenchement se fait sur un échec de lancement offensif selon la procédure RMU. Ce Défaut ne transforme pas un sort non offensif en attaque contre un allié.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Friendslayer","system":{"description":"<h1>Friendslayer</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Your failures with offensive spells sometimes endanger your own allies. When you fail to cast an attack spell and an ally is a valid target within the spell’s range, the GM randomly chooses one such ally: the spell turns against them instead of being resolved as an ordinary failure.</p><p>The new target receives all defenses and Resistance Rolls to which they would normally be entitled. If there is no valid ally within range, the failure is resolved normally.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The trigger is an offensive casting failure under RMU procedure. This Flaw does not turn a non-offensive spell into an attack against an ally.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Défauts — Spéciaux"],"en":["Flaws — Special"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["flaws-special"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Magical","name":"Friendslayer","cost":"-10","tier":0,"maxTier":1,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Friendslayer</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Your failures with offensive spells sometimes endanger your own allies. When you fail to cast an attack spell and an ally is a valid target within the spell’s range, the GM randomly chooses one such ally: the spell turns against them instead of being resolved as an ordinary failure.</p><p>The new target receives all defenses and Resistance Rolls to which they would normally be entitled. If there is no valid ally within range, the failure is resolved normally.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The trigger is an offensive casting failure under RMU procedure. This Flaw does not turn a non-offensive spell into an attack against an ally.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_friendslayer.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"uLrzLUFbfVI30XZb"}
{"name":"Gardener","type":"talent","img":"icons/skills/movement/ball-spinning-blue.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"gardener","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"talent","restrictions":{"races":["Hobbits","Periannath"]},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"gardener","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"talents-cultural","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Jardinier (Gardener)","system":{"description":"<h1>Jardinier (Gardener)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous avez la main verte. Dans la tradition hobbite, vous savez faire pousser de beaux légumes, des herbes et des champignons particulièrement réussis. Votre expérience renforce aussi vos connaissances de la flore et des herbes.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Vous gagnez <strong>+5 par Tier</strong> aux Manœuvres pertinentes d’horticulture, d’agriculture à petite échelle, de flore ou d’herbes lorsque votre expérience de jardinier s’applique réellement.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Gardener","system":{"description":"<h1>Gardener</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You have a green thumb. In Hobbit tradition, you know how to grow fine vegetables, herbs, and especially good mushrooms. Your experience also strengthens your knowledge of flora and herbs.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>You gain <strong>+5 per Tier</strong> to relevant horticulture, small-scale agriculture, flora, or herb Maneuvers whenever your gardening experience genuinely applies.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Talents — Culturels"],"en":["Talents — Cultural"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["talents-cultural"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Other","name":"Gardener","cost":"5/Tier","tier":0,"maxTier":2,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Gardener</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You have a green thumb. In Hobbit tradition, you know how to grow fine vegetables, herbs, and especially good mushrooms. Your experience also strengthens your knowledge of flora and herbs.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>You gain <strong>+5 per Tier</strong> to relevant horticulture, small-scale agriculture, flora, or herb Maneuvers whenever your gardening experience genuinely applies.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_gardener.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"5rVodlJIJrEgoDk0"}
{"name":"Gift of Mahal","type":"talent","img":"icons/skills/movement/ball-spinning-blue.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"gift-of-mahal","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"talent","restrictions":{"races":["Khazâd","Naugrim"]},"descriptionVersion":3,"compendiumSourceKey":"gift-of-mahal","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"talents-cultural","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Don de Mahal (Gift of Mahal)","system":{"description":"<h1>Don de Mahal (Gift of Mahal)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Mahal vous a accordé un don exceptionnel pour préserver la vie et favoriser la guérison. Votre intuition et votre précision rendent vos soins particulièrement efficaces.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><p>Vous recevez <strong>+5/Tier</strong> aux Manœuvres que vous effectuez personnellement pour soigner une blessure, traiter une affection ou stabiliser un patient, jusqu’à +10 au Tier II.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Le très important bonus historique est ramené à l’échelle RMU. Le Talent n’augmente pas automatiquement la puissance d’un sort de guérison ; il s’applique aux Manœuvres de soin lorsqu’un jet est réellement effectué.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Gift of Mahal","system":{"description":"<h1>Gift of Mahal</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Mahal has granted you an exceptional gift for preserving life and promoting healing. Your intuition and precision make your care especially effective.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><p>You receive <strong>+5/Tier</strong> to Maneuvers you personally perform to treat an injury, address an affliction, or stabilize a patient, up to +10 at Tier II.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The very large historical bonus is reduced to the RMU scale. The Talent does not automatically increase the power of a healing spell; it applies to healing Maneuvers when a roll is actually made.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Talents — Culturels"],"en":["Talents — Cultural"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["talents-cultural"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Magical","name":"Gift of Mahal","cost":"10/Tier","tier":0,"maxTier":2,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Gift of Mahal</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Mahal has granted you an exceptional gift for preserving life and promoting healing. Your intuition and precision make your care especially effective.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><p>You receive <strong>+5/Tier</strong> to Maneuvers you personally perform to treat an injury, address an affliction, or stabilize a patient, up to +10 at Tier II.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The very large historical bonus is reduced to the RMU scale. The Talent does not automatically increase the power of a healing spell; it applies to healing Maneuvers when a roll is actually made.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_gift-of-mahal.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"AKWHJ6FsmD5gcU5L"}
{"name":"Good Battlefield Awareness","type":"talent","img":"icons/skills/movement/ball-spinning-blue.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"good-battlefield-awareness","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"talent","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"good-battlefield-awareness","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"talents-mental","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Conscience du champ de bataille (Good Battlefield Awareness)","system":{"description":"<h1>Conscience du champ de bataille (Good Battlefield Awareness)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous lisez instinctivement la situation d’un combat : mouvements, ouvertures, menaces, angles d’approche et changements rapides du rapport de force. Cette perception améliore votre conscience situationnelle en combat et votre capacité à répondre à une menace venant d’une direction inattendue.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Vous gagnez <strong>+5 par Tier</strong> aux jets de Perception explicitement liés à une menace ou à une situation tactique de combat. Le Talent ne donne pas automatiquement connaissance de ce qui est réellement invisible ou impossible à percevoir.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Good Battlefield Awareness","system":{"description":"<h1>Good Battlefield Awareness</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You instinctively read the flow of battle: movement, openings, threats, angles of approach, and rapid changes in the balance of force. This awareness improves your combat situational awareness and your ability to respond to a threat coming from an unexpected direction.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>You gain <strong>+5 per Tier</strong> to Perception rolls explicitly related to a threat or tactical combat situation. The Talent does not automatically reveal anything that is truly invisible or impossible to perceive.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Talents — Mentaux"],"en":["Talents — Mental"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["talents-mental"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Senses","name":"Good Battlefield Awareness","cost":"5/Tier","tier":0,"maxTier":3,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Good Battlefield Awareness</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You instinctively read the flow of battle: movement, openings, threats, angles of approach, and rapid changes in the balance of force. This awareness improves your combat situational awareness and your ability to respond to a threat coming from an unexpected direction.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>You gain <strong>+5 per Tier</strong> to Perception rolls explicitly related to a threat or tactical combat situation. The Talent does not automatically reveal anything that is truly invisible or impossible to perceive.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_good-battlefield-awareness.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"edwNlYo2gVDiXEkr"}
{"name":"Gourmand","type":"talent","img":"icons/skills/movement/ball-spinning-blue.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"gourmand","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"talent","restrictions":{"races":["Hobbits","Periannath"]},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"gourmand","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"talents-cultural","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Gourmand (Gourmand)","system":{"description":"<h1>Gourmand (Gourmand)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous aimez manger, souvent et bien, et cette passion vous a rendu particulièrement habile en cuisine. Votre talent améliore la cuisine en général et vous excellez particulièrement dans un plat précis choisi lors de l’acquisition.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Vous gagnez <strong>+10</strong> aux Manœuvres de cuisine et <strong>+15 supplémentaire</strong> lorsqu’il s’agit de votre plat de prédilection, choisi à l’acquisition du Talent.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Gourmand","system":{"description":"<h1>Gourmand</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You love to eat, often and well, and this passion has made you particularly skilled at cooking. Your talent improves cooking in general, and you excel especially at one specific dish chosen when the Talent is acquired.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>You gain <strong>+10</strong> to Cooking Maneuvers and an <strong>additional +15</strong> when preparing your signature dish, chosen when you acquire the Talent.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Talents — Culturels"],"en":["Talents — Cultural"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["talents-cultural"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Other","name":"Gourmand","cost":"3","tier":0,"maxTier":1,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Gourmand</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You love to eat, often and well, and this passion has made you particularly skilled at cooking. Your talent improves cooking in general, and you excel especially at one specific dish chosen when the Talent is acquired.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>You gain <strong>+10</strong> to Cooking Maneuvers and an <strong>additional +15</strong> when preparing your signature dish, chosen when you acquire the Talent.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_gourmand.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"TaICw3pu0zRfKB8z"}
{"name":"Herbalist","type":"talent","img":"icons/skills/movement/ball-spinning-blue.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"herbalist","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"talent","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"herbalist","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"talents-general","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Herboriste (Herbalist)","system":{"description":"<h1>Herboriste (Herbalist)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous possédez une aptitude naturelle à reconnaître les herbes, les plantes médicinales et les poisons, ainsi qu’à comprendre leur préparation et leur emploi. Cette aptitude facilite la cuisine, la recherche de nourriture, l’utilisation et la préparation des herbes, ainsi que les connaissances des herbes et des poisons.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Les bonus sont adaptés à l’échelle de RMU. Vous gagnez <strong>+5 par Tier</strong> aux Manœuvres directement liées à l’identification, la récolte, la préparation ou l’utilisation des herbes et poisons, lorsque la Compétence employée est pertinente. Ce Talent n’accorde pas automatiquement la connaissance d’une plante inconnue ni l’accès à des préparations que le personnage ne pourrait normalement réaliser.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Herbalist","system":{"description":"<h1>Herbalist</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You possess a natural aptitude for recognizing herbs, medicinal plants, and poisons, as well as for understanding their preparation and use. This aptitude makes cooking, foraging, the use and preparation of herbs, and knowledge of herbs and poisons easier.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The bonuses are adapted to the RMU scale. You gain <strong>+5 per Tier</strong> to Maneuvers directly related to identifying, gathering, preparing, or using herbs and poisons when the Skill being used is relevant. This Talent does not automatically grant knowledge of an unknown plant or access to preparations the character could not normally make.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Talents — Généraux"],"en":["Talents — General"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["talents-general"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Other","name":"Herbalist","cost":"7/Tier","tier":0,"maxTier":3,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Herbalist</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You possess a natural aptitude for recognizing herbs, medicinal plants, and poisons, as well as for understanding their preparation and use. This aptitude makes cooking, foraging, the use and preparation of herbs, and knowledge of herbs and poisons easier.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The bonuses are adapted to the RMU scale. You gain <strong>+5 per Tier</strong> to Maneuvers directly related to identifying, gathering, preparing, or using herbs and poisons when the Skill being used is relevant. This Talent does not automatically grant knowledge of an unknown plant or access to preparations the character could not normally make.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_herbalist.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"QGpm0qQMU5PFQPsu"}
{"name":"Immovable Will","type":"talent","img":"icons/skills/movement/ball-spinning-blue.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"immovable-will","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"talent","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"immovable-will","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"talents-mental","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Volonté inébranlable (Immovable Will)","system":{"description":"<h1>Volonté inébranlable (Immovable Will)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Votre volonté est exceptionnellement difficile à ébranler. Cette volonté renforce vos résistances contre la peur, le charme et les effets qui cherchent à vous soumettre mentalement.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Vous gagnez <strong>+5 par Tier</strong> aux Jets de Résistance contre la <strong>Peur</strong>, le <strong>Charme</strong> et les effets de domination mentale comparables. Les effets purement physiques ou ne mettant pas la volonté en jeu ne bénéficient pas de ce bonus.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Immovable Will","system":{"description":"<h1>Immovable Will</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Your will is exceptionally difficult to shake. This strength of will reinforces your resistance to fear, charm, and effects that seek to dominate you mentally.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>You gain <strong>+5 per Tier</strong> to Resistance Rolls against <strong>Fear</strong>, <strong>Charm</strong>, and comparable mental domination effects. Purely physical effects or those that do not test the will do not benefit from this bonus.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Talents — Mentaux"],"en":["Talents — Mental"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["talents-mental"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Discipline","name":"Immovable Will","cost":"5/Tier","tier":0,"maxTier":3,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Immovable Will</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Your will is exceptionally difficult to shake. This strength of will reinforces your resistance to fear, charm, and effects that seek to dominate you mentally.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>You gain <strong>+5 per Tier</strong> to Resistance Rolls against <strong>Fear</strong>, <strong>Charm</strong>, and comparable mental domination effects. Purely physical effects or those that do not test the will do not benefit from this bonus.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_immovable-will.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"bcx6EioSRSh3KDLW"}
{"name":"Impulsive","type":"talent","img":"icons/magic/movement/abstract-ribbons-red-orange.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"impulsive","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"flaw","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"impulsive","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"flaws-mental","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Impulsif (Impulsive)","system":{"description":"<h1>Impulsif (Impulsive)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous avez tendance à agir avant d’avoir évalué les conséquences. Une provocation, une occasion soudaine ou un danger immédiat peut vous pousser à prendre une décision rapide alors qu’un personnage plus prudent hésiterait ou chercherait davantage d’informations.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Le Défaut doit produire de véritables choix de jeu. Lorsque le joueur souhaite réprimer une impulsion particulièrement forte, le MJ peut demander une Manœuvre de Discipline ou un Jet de Résistance approprié.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Impulsive","system":{"description":"<h1>Impulsive</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You tend to act before evaluating the consequences. A provocation, sudden opportunity, or immediate danger may push you to make a quick decision where a more cautious character would hesitate or seek more information.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The Flaw should produce genuine choices in play. When the player wishes to suppress a particularly strong impulse, the GM may require a Discipline Maneuver or an appropriate Resistance Roll.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Défauts — Mentaux"],"en":["Flaws — Mental"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["flaws-mental"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Discipline","name":"Impulsive","cost":"-7","tier":0,"maxTier":1,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Impulsive</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You tend to act before evaluating the consequences. A provocation, sudden opportunity, or immediate danger may push you to make a quick decision where a more cautious character would hesitate or seek more information.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The Flaw should produce genuine choices in play. When the player wishes to suppress a particularly strong impulse, the GM may require a Discipline Maneuver or an appropriate Resistance Roll.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_impulsive.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"7002E4lIuztgoogr"}
{"name":"Judge of Angles","type":"talent","img":"icons/skills/movement/ball-spinning-blue.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"judge-of-angles","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"talent","restrictions":{"races":["Khazâd","Naugrim"]},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"judge-of-angles","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"talents-cultural","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Juge des angles (Judge of Angles)","system":{"description":"<h1>Juge des angles (Judge of Angles)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous savez juger presque immédiatement l’angle d’une pente et remarquer les changements infimes d’inclinaison sur des surfaces solides et relativement régulières. Cette aptitude vous aide particulièrement à repérer les pièges et passages secrets intégrés aux murs, sols et plafonds.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Vous gagnez <strong>+5 par Tier</strong> aux jets de Perception visant une anomalie géométrique dans la pierre, la maçonnerie, un mur, un sol ou un plafond : pente anormale, raccord imparfait, panneau dissimulé, mécanisme intégré, etc.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Judge of Angles","system":{"description":"<h1>Judge of Angles</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You can almost instantly judge the angle of a slope and notice minute changes in inclination across solid, relatively regular surfaces. This aptitude is especially useful for detecting traps and secret passages built into walls, floors, and ceilings.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>You gain <strong>+5 per Tier</strong> to Perception rolls aimed at detecting a geometric anomaly in stone, masonry, a wall, floor, or ceiling: an unusual slope, imperfect join, concealed panel, integrated mechanism, and so on.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Talents — Culturels"],"en":["Talents — Cultural"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["talents-cultural"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Racial","name":"Judge of Angles","cost":"5/Tier","tier":0,"maxTier":2,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Judge of Angles</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You can almost instantly judge the angle of a slope and notice minute changes in inclination across solid, relatively regular surfaces. This aptitude is especially useful for detecting traps and secret passages built into walls, floors, and ceilings.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>You gain <strong>+5 per Tier</strong> to Perception rolls aimed at detecting a geometric anomaly in stone, masonry, a wall, floor, or ceiling: an unusual slope, imperfect join, concealed panel, integrated mechanism, and so on.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_judge-of-angles.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"5OwXK3rnLswyb9KK"}
{"name":"Lack of Range","type":"talent","img":"icons/magic/movement/abstract-ribbons-red-orange.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"lack-of-range","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"flaw","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"lack-of-range","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"flaws-physical","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Portée réduite (Lack of Range)","system":{"description":"<h1>Portée réduite (Lack of Range)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous éprouvez une difficulté inhabituelle à viser ou à projeter vos effets à grande distance. <strong>toutes les portées de tir et de lancement de sorts étaient divisées par deux</strong>.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>La même intention est conservée : les portées maximales de vos attaques à distance et des sorts que vous projetez sont <strong>réduites de moitié</strong>, sauf lorsque l’effet ne dépend manifestement pas de votre capacité à viser ou à projeter. Le MJ tranche les cas particuliers.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Lack of Range","system":{"description":"<h1>Lack of Range</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You have unusual difficulty aiming or projecting your effects over long distances. <strong>All missile and spell-casting ranges were halved</strong>.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The same intent is retained: the maximum ranges of your ranged attacks and projected spells are <strong>halved</strong>, except when the effect clearly does not depend on your ability to aim or project it. The GM adjudicates special cases.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Défauts — Physiques"],"en":["Flaws — Physical"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["flaws-physical"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Other","name":"Lack of Range","cost":"-15","tier":0,"maxTier":1,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Lack of Range</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You have unusual difficulty aiming or projecting your effects over long distances. <strong>All missile and spell-casting ranges were halved</strong>.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The same intent is retained: the maximum ranges of your ranged attacks and projected spells are <strong>halved</strong>, except when the effect clearly does not depend on your ability to aim or project it. The GM adjudicates special cases.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_lack-of-range.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"crL6mEkUsEK8HbhO"}
{"name":"Lack of Scope","type":"talent","img":"icons/magic/movement/abstract-ribbons-red-orange.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"lack-of-scope","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"flaw","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":3,"compendiumSourceKey":"lack-of-scope","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"flaws-special","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Portée d’effet réduite (Lack of Scope)","system":{"description":"<h1>Portée d’effet réduite (Lack of Scope)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous avez du mal à étendre correctement la zone d’effet de vos sorts. Le <strong>rayon</strong> d’une zone ou le <strong>nombre de cibles</strong> qu’un sort peut affecter est divisé par deux, en arrondissant au supérieur.</p><p>Un sort limité à une seule cible continue donc d’affecter une cible, tandis qu’un rayon de 10 pieds devient un rayon de 5 pieds.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Seuls les sorts dont l’aire d’effet repose réellement sur un rayon, une dimension comparable ou un nombre de cibles sont concernés. Les autres formes d’aire d’effet restent inchangées sauf décision explicite du MJ.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Lack of Scope","system":{"description":"<h1>Lack of Scope</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You have difficulty properly extending the area of effect of your spells. The <strong>radius</strong> of an area or the <strong>number of targets</strong> a spell can affect is halved, rounding up.</p><p>A spell limited to a single target therefore still affects one target, while a 10-foot radius becomes a 5-foot radius.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>Only spells whose area of effect genuinely depends on a radius, comparable dimension, or number of targets are affected. Other area shapes remain unchanged unless the GM explicitly rules otherwise.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Défauts — Spéciaux"],"en":["Flaws — Special"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["flaws-special"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Magical","name":"Lack of Scope","cost":"-20","tier":0,"maxTier":1,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Lack of Scope</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You have difficulty properly extending the area of effect of your spells. The <strong>radius</strong> of an area or the <strong>number of targets</strong> a spell can affect is halved, rounding up.</p><p>A spell limited to a single target therefore still affects one target, while a 10-foot radius becomes a 5-foot radius.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>Only spells whose area of effect genuinely depends on a radius, comparable dimension, or number of targets are affected. Other area shapes remain unchanged unless the GM explicitly rules otherwise.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_lack-of-scope.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"TWK7fTzNRCG3q4kM"}
{"name":"Lack of Time","type":"talent","img":"icons/magic/movement/abstract-ribbons-red-orange.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"lack-of-time","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"flaw","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":3,"compendiumSourceKey":"lack-of-time","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"flaws-special","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Durée réduite (Lack of Time)","system":{"description":"<h1>Durée réduite (Lack of Time)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vos sorts persistent moins longtemps qu’ils ne le devraient. Toute durée chronométrée d’un sort que vous lancez est <strong>divisée par deux</strong>, en arrondissant au round supérieur lorsque cela est nécessaire.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Les sorts <strong>Instantanés</strong> et les effets dont la durée dépend uniquement de la <strong>Concentration</strong> ne sont pas réduits par ce Défaut. Lorsqu’un sort possède à la fois une durée fixe et une exigence de concentration, seule sa composante chronométrée est divisée par deux.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Lack of Time","system":{"description":"<h1>Lack of Time</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Your spells persist for less time than they should. Any timed duration of a spell you cast is <strong>halved</strong>, rounding up to the next round when necessary.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p><strong>Instantaneous</strong> spells and effects whose duration depends solely on <strong>Concentration</strong> are not reduced by this Flaw. When a spell has both a fixed duration and a concentration requirement, only its timed component is halved.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Défauts — Spéciaux"],"en":["Flaws — Special"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["flaws-special"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Magical","name":"Lack of Time","cost":"-20","tier":0,"maxTier":1,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Lack of Time</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Your spells persist for less time than they should. Any timed duration of a spell you cast is <strong>halved</strong>, rounding up to the next round when necessary.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p><strong>Instantaneous</strong> spells and effects whose duration depends solely on <strong>Concentration</strong> are not reduced by this Flaw. When a spell has both a fixed duration and a concentration requirement, only its timed component is halved.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_lack-of-time.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"p4ryWmL3v8hdsMJm"}
{"name":"Lesser Dúnedain","type":"talent","img":"icons/magic/movement/abstract-ribbons-red-orange.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"lesser-dunadan","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"flaw","restrictions":{"cultures":["Dúnedain Arnor","Dúnedain d’Arnor","Dúnedain (of the Lost Realm)","Dúnedain du Royaume Perdu"]},"descriptionVersion":3,"compendiumSourceKey":"lesser-dunadan","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"flaws-physical","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Sang dúnadan affaibli (Lesser Dúnedain)","system":{"description":"<h1>Sang dúnadan affaibli (Lesser Dúnedain)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Votre lignée dúnadan s’est affaiblie au fil des générations et des unions avec les populations locales. Les différents Tiers représentent un éloignement croissant de l’héritage physique des Dúnedain du Royaume Perdu.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><p><strong>Tier I :</strong> votre espérance de vie est ramenée à environ <strong>90–125 ans</strong>.</p><p><strong>Tier II :</strong> vous subissez en plus <strong>−5 aux Jets de Résistance contre les maladies</strong>.</p><p><strong>Tier III :</strong> vous subissez en plus <strong>−1 au bonus de Constitution</strong>.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Les anciennes modifications de progression de Développement Corporel ne sont pas transposées directement. Elles sont remplacées par des effets simples et compatibles avec RMU tout en conservant l’idée d’un héritage dúnadan progressivement affaibli.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Lesser Dúnedain","system":{"description":"<h1>Lesser Dúnedain</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Your Dúnedain bloodline has weakened over generations and through unions with local populations. The different Tiers represent increasing distance from the physical heritage of the Dúnedain of the Lost Realm.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><p><strong>Tier I:</strong> your lifespan is reduced to about <strong>90–125 years</strong>.</p><p><strong>Tier II:</strong> you additionally suffer <strong>−5 to Resistance Rolls against disease</strong>.</p><p><strong>Tier III:</strong> you additionally suffer <strong>−1 to your Constitution bonus</strong>.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The old changes to Body Development progression are not directly converted. They are replaced by simple effects compatible with RMU while preserving the idea of a progressively weakened Dúnedain heritage.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Défauts — Physiques"],"en":["Flaws — Physical"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["flaws-physical"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Racial","name":"Lesser Dúnedain","cost":"-5/Tier","tier":0,"maxTier":3,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Lesser Dúnedain</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Your Dúnedain bloodline has weakened over generations and through unions with local populations. The different Tiers represent increasing distance from the physical heritage of the Dúnedain of the Lost Realm.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><p><strong>Tier I:</strong> your lifespan is reduced to about <strong>90–125 years</strong>.</p><p><strong>Tier II:</strong> you additionally suffer <strong>−5 to Resistance Rolls against disease</strong>.</p><p><strong>Tier III:</strong> you additionally suffer <strong>−1 to your Constitution bonus</strong>.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The old changes to Body Development progression are not directly converted. They are replaced by simple effects compatible with RMU while preserving the idea of a progressively weakened Dúnedain heritage.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_lesser-dunadan.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"EZTfpWxKHkXOuEDc"}
{"name":"Light of Aman","type":"talent","img":"icons/skills/movement/ball-spinning-blue.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"light-of-aman","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"talent","restrictions":{"cultures":["Noldor"]},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"light-of-aman","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"talents-cultural","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Lumière d’Aman (Light of Aman)","system":{"description":"<h1>Lumière d’Aman (Light of Aman)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous avez contemplé la lumière des Deux Arbres d’Aman et en portez encore une pâle réflexion. Cette présence peut demeurer discrète si vous le souhaitez, mais les êtres moindres peuvent la pressentir comme un éclat à la limite de leur perception. Elle renforce légèrement votre Présence et marque votre nature spirituelle de façon perceptible aux êtres capables de la discerner.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Le Talent conserve surtout sa <strong>nature spirituelle et historique</strong>. Il exige que l’âge et l’histoire du personnage rendent plausible la contemplation d’Aman. Les anciens paramètres de Race Type et de Soul Departure ne sont pas transposés littéralement en RMU ; le MJ peut reconnaître l’aura dans les interactions ou effets surnaturels où l’origine amanienne est pertinente.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Light of Aman","system":{"description":"<h1>Light of Aman</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You have beheld the light of the Two Trees of Aman and still carry a pale reflection of it. This presence can remain subtle if you wish, but lesser beings may sense it as a glimmer at the edge of perception. It slightly strengthens your Presence and marks your spiritual nature in a way perceptible to beings capable of discerning it.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The Talent chiefly preserves its <strong>spiritual and historical nature</strong>. The character’s age and history must make it plausible that they saw Aman. The old Race Type and Soul Departure parameters are not translated literally into RMU; the GM may recognize the aura in interactions or supernatural effects where Amanian origin is relevant.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Talents — Culturels"],"en":["Talents — Cultural"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["talents-cultural"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Racial","name":"Light of Aman","cost":"15","tier":0,"maxTier":1,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Light of Aman</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You have beheld the light of the Two Trees of Aman and still carry a pale reflection of it. This presence can remain subtle if you wish, but lesser beings may sense it as a glimmer at the edge of perception. It slightly strengthens your Presence and marks your spiritual nature in a way perceptible to beings capable of discerning it.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The Talent chiefly preserves its <strong>spiritual and historical nature</strong>. The character’s age and history must make it plausible that they saw Aman. The old Race Type and Soul Departure parameters are not translated literally into RMU; the GM may recognize the aura in interactions or supernatural effects where Amanian origin is relevant.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_light-of-aman.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"0aD5y94IqLmGNjXg"}
{"name":"Loss of Vision","type":"talent","img":"icons/magic/movement/abstract-ribbons-red-orange.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"loss-of-vision","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"flaw","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"loss-of-vision","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"flaws-physical","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Perte de vision (Loss of Vision)","system":{"description":"<h1>Perte de vision (Loss of Vision)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Un traumatisme à la tête peut provoquer chez vous une cécité temporaire. Chaque traumatisme important à la tête peut provoquer une cécité temporaire de plusieurs minutes avant le retour progressif de la vision.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Lorsqu’un Critique ou un résultat de blessure affecte significativement la tête, le MJ peut déclencher le test prévu pour ce Défaut. En cas d’échec, le personnage est temporairement aveugle et subit les règles RMU correspondantes jusqu’au retour de la vision.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Loss of Vision","system":{"description":"<h1>Loss of Vision</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Head trauma can cause you temporary blindness. Any significant injury to the head may produce several minutes of blindness before your sight gradually returns.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>When a Critical or injury result significantly affects the head, the GM may trigger the test associated with this Flaw. On a failure, the character is temporarily blind and suffers the corresponding RMU effects until vision returns.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Défauts — Physiques"],"en":["Flaws — Physical"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["flaws-physical"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Senses","name":"Loss of Vision","cost":"-10","tier":0,"maxTier":1,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Loss of Vision</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Head trauma can cause you temporary blindness. Any significant injury to the head may produce several minutes of blindness before your sight gradually returns.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>When a Critical or injury result significantly affects the head, the GM may trigger the test associated with this Flaw. On a failure, the character is temporarily blind and suffers the corresponding RMU effects until vision returns.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_loss-of-vision.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"D4sa2h7gY5ULBpbu"}
{"name":"Magic Allergy","type":"talent","img":"icons/magic/movement/abstract-ribbons-red-orange.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"magic-allergy","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"flaw","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"magic-allergy","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"flaws-special","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Allergie à la magie (Magic Allergy)","system":{"description":"<h1>Allergie à la magie (Magic Allergy)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Votre organisme ou votre esprit réagit violemment à certains Royaumes de magie. Utiliser un sort ou un objet magique du Royaume concerné peut provoquer une réaction violente, et la proximité d’une manifestation importante de cette magie comporte également un risque. Les Tiers supérieurs étendent l’allergie à deux puis trois Royaumes.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><ul><li><strong>Tier I :</strong> allergie à un Royaume.</li><li><strong>Tier II :</strong> allergie à deux Royaumes.</li><li><strong>Tier III :</strong> allergie aux trois Royaumes.</li></ul><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Les anciens pourcentages et durées sont adaptés aux règles RMU. Utiliser directement une magie concernée doit comporter un risque majeur d’incapacitation ; être à proximité d’une manifestation importante peut également imposer un test. Le Royaume ou les Royaumes sont choisis à l’acquisition.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Magic Allergy","system":{"description":"<h1>Magic Allergy</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Your body or mind reacts violently to certain Realms of magic. Using a spell or magical object from the affected Realm can provoke a severe reaction, and being near a major manifestation of that magic also carries a risk. Higher Tiers extend the allergy to two and then three Realms.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><ul><li><strong>Tier I:</strong> allergy to one Realm.</li><li><strong>Tier II:</strong> allergy to two Realms.</li><li><strong>Tier III:</strong> allergy to all three Realms.</li></ul><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The old percentages and durations are adapted to RMU rules. Directly using affected magic should carry a major risk of incapacitation; proximity to an important manifestation may also require a test. The affected Realm or Realms are chosen when the Flaw is acquired.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Défauts — Spéciaux"],"en":["Flaws — Special"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["flaws-special"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Magical","name":"Magic Allergy","cost":"-10/Tier","tier":0,"maxTier":3,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Magic Allergy</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Your body or mind reacts violently to certain Realms of magic. Using a spell or magical object from the affected Realm can provoke a severe reaction, and being near a major manifestation of that magic also carries a risk. Higher Tiers extend the allergy to two and then three Realms.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><ul><li><strong>Tier I:</strong> allergy to one Realm.</li><li><strong>Tier II:</strong> allergy to two Realms.</li><li><strong>Tier III:</strong> allergy to all three Realms.</li></ul><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The old percentages and durations are adapted to RMU rules. Directly using affected magic should carry a major risk of incapacitation; proximity to an important manifestation may also require a test. The affected Realm or Realms are chosen when the Flaw is acquired.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_magic-allergy.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"24ZcF81jwhQdvCZy"}
{"name":"Magically Susceptible","type":"talent","img":"icons/magic/movement/abstract-ribbons-red-orange.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"magically-susceptible","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"flaw","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":3,"compendiumSourceKey":"magically-susceptible","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"flaws-special","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Sensibilité à la magie (Magically Susceptible)","system":{"description":"<h1>Sensibilité à la magie (Magically Susceptible)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous résistez moins bien aux effets magiques que la plupart des êtres. Lors de l’acquisition du Défaut, choisissez l’une des deux formes suivantes :</p><ul><li><strong>Un Royaume :</strong> vous subissez <strong>−10</strong> à vos Jets de Résistance contre les sorts et effets magiques de ce Royaume.</li><li><strong>Toute magie :</strong> vous subissez <strong>−5</strong> à vos Jets de Résistance contre tous les sorts et dispositifs magiques.</li></ul><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Les anciennes pénalités de −25 ou −15 ont été réduites à l’échelle RMU. Le choix effectué lors de l’acquisition est définitif sauf accord du MJ.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Magically Susceptible","system":{"description":"<h1>Magically Susceptible</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You resist magical effects less effectively than most beings. When acquiring this Flaw, choose one of the following two forms:</p><ul><li><strong>One Realm:</strong> you suffer <strong>−10</strong> to Resistance Rolls against spells and magical effects from that Realm.</li><li><strong>All magic:</strong> you suffer <strong>−5</strong> to Resistance Rolls against all spells and magical devices.</li></ul><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The old penalties of −25 or −15 have been reduced to the RMU scale. The choice made when the Flaw is acquired is permanent unless the GM agrees otherwise.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Défauts — Spéciaux"],"en":["Flaws — Special"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["flaws-special"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Magical","name":"Magically Susceptible","cost":"-15","tier":0,"maxTier":1,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Magically Susceptible</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You resist magical effects less effectively than most beings. When acquiring this Flaw, choose one of the following two forms:</p><ul><li><strong>One Realm:</strong> you suffer <strong>−10</strong> to Resistance Rolls against spells and magical effects from that Realm.</li><li><strong>All magic:</strong> you suffer <strong>−5</strong> to Resistance Rolls against all spells and magical devices.</li></ul><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The old penalties of −25 or −15 have been reduced to the RMU scale. The choice made when the Flaw is acquired is permanent unless the GM agrees otherwise.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_magically-susceptible.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"DsvBdkDqFMVQ6Wzy"}
{"name":"Magically Vulnerable","type":"talent","img":"icons/magic/movement/abstract-ribbons-red-orange.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"magically-vulnerable","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"flaw","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":3,"compendiumSourceKey":"magically-vulnerable","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"flaws-special","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Vulnérabilité magique (Magically Vulnerable)","system":{"description":"<h1>Vulnérabilité magique (Magically Vulnerable)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>La magie offensive vous atteint avec une facilité anormale. Lorsqu’un sort dirigé contre vous utilise un jet d’attaque, le lanceur reçoit un <strong>bonus situationnel de +5</strong> à ce jet.</p><p>Ce Défaut n’applique pas de pénalité supplémentaire à vos Jets de Résistance : cette faiblesse est représentée séparément par <em>Sensibilité à la magie</em>.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>L’ancien bonus de +10 aux jets BAR/EAR a été ramené à +5 et appliqué aux jets d’attaque magique correspondants de RMU.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Magically Vulnerable","system":{"description":"<h1>Magically Vulnerable</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Offensive magic strikes you with abnormal ease. When a spell directed against you uses an attack roll, the caster receives a <strong>+5 situational bonus</strong> to that roll.</p><p>This Flaw does not impose an additional penalty on your Resistance Rolls: that weakness is represented separately by <em>Magically Susceptible</em>.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The old +10 bonus to BAR/EAR rolls has been reduced to +5 and applied to the corresponding RMU magical attack rolls.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Défauts — Spéciaux"],"en":["Flaws — Special"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["flaws-special"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Magical","name":"Magically Vulnerable","cost":"-10","tier":0,"maxTier":1,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Magically Vulnerable</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Offensive magic strikes you with abnormal ease. When a spell directed against you uses an attack roll, the caster receives a <strong>+5 situational bonus</strong> to that roll.</p><p>This Flaw does not impose an additional penalty on your Resistance Rolls: that weakness is represented separately by <em>Magically Susceptible</em>.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The old +10 bonus to BAR/EAR rolls has been reduced to +5 and applied to the corresponding RMU magical attack rolls.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_magically-vulnerable.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"9PrbxgpYD3lpqsxp"}
{"name":"Mana Sensing","type":"talent","img":"icons/skills/movement/ball-spinning-blue.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"mana-sensing","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"talent","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"mana-sensing","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"talents-mystical","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Perception de la Mana (Mana Sensing)","system":{"description":"<h1>Perception de la Mana (Mana Sensing)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous êtes sensible aux concentrations de puissance magique. Une forte accumulation de pouvoir, un lieu profondément enchanté ou une manifestation magique importante peut produire pour vous une sensation perceptible, sans que vous compreniez automatiquement sa nature.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Le Talent permet de <strong>ressentir la présence</strong> d’une puissance inhabituelle ; il ne remplace pas Accord, les Connaissances magiques ni les moyens précis d’analyse. La portée et la finesse dépendent de l’intensité du phénomène et de l’appréciation du MJ.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Mana Sensing","system":{"description":"<h1>Mana Sensing</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You are sensitive to concentrations of magical power. A strong accumulation of power, a deeply enchanted place, or an important magical manifestation may produce a perceptible sensation for you without automatically revealing its nature.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The Talent allows you to <strong>sense the presence</strong> of unusual power; it does not replace Attunement, magical Lore, or precise means of analysis. Range and sensitivity depend on the intensity of the phenomenon and the GM’s judgment.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Talents — Mystiques"],"en":["Talents — Mystical"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["talents-mystical"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Magical","name":"Mana Sensing","cost":"5","tier":0,"maxTier":1,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Mana Sensing</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You are sensitive to concentrations of magical power. A strong accumulation of power, a deeply enchanted place, or an important magical manifestation may produce a perceptible sensation for you without automatically revealing its nature.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The Talent allows you to <strong>sense the presence</strong> of unusual power; it does not replace Attunement, magical Lore, or precise means of analysis. Range and sensitivity depend on the intensity of the phenomenon and the GM’s judgment.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_mana-sensing.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"YaeIVqNA8Es6jZXI"}
{"name":"Master Tactician","type":"talent","img":"icons/skills/movement/ball-spinning-blue.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"master-tactician","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"talent","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"master-tactician","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"talents-mental","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Maître tacticien (Master Tactician)","system":{"description":"<h1>Maître tacticien (Master Tactician)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous avez un talent particulier pour analyser un affrontement, organiser les forces disponibles et exploiter terrain, rythme et positionnement. ce Talent accordait un bonus direct à la Compétence Tactics.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Vous gagnez <strong>+5 par Tier</strong> à <strong>Tactique (Tactics)</strong>. Ce bonus concerne l’analyse et la conduite tactiques ; il ne remplace pas le Commandement lorsque l’enjeu est de convaincre ou de diriger des personnes.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Master Tactician","system":{"description":"<h1>Master Tactician</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You have a particular talent for analyzing a confrontation, organizing the forces available, and exploiting terrain, tempo, and positioning. This Talent originally granted a direct bonus to the Tactics Skill.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>You gain <strong>+5 per Tier</strong> to <strong>Tactics</strong>. This bonus concerns tactical analysis and direction; it does not replace Leadership when the issue is persuading or directing people.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Talents — Mentaux"],"en":["Talents — Mental"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["talents-mental"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Other","name":"Master Tactician","cost":"5/Tier","tier":0,"maxTier":3,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Master Tactician</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You have a particular talent for analyzing a confrontation, organizing the forces available, and exploiting terrain, tempo, and positioning. This Talent originally granted a direct bonus to the Tactics Skill.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>You gain <strong>+5 per Tier</strong> to <strong>Tactics</strong>. This bonus concerns tactical analysis and direction; it does not replace Leadership when the issue is persuading or directing people.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_master-tactician.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"zJh3Bwz1f6FDdBFA"}
{"name":"Mind Over Matter","type":"talent","img":"icons/skills/movement/ball-spinning-blue.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"mind-over-matter","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"talent","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"mind-over-matter","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"talents-mental","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Esprit sur la matière (Mind Over Matter)","system":{"description":"<h1>Esprit sur la matière (Mind Over Matter)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous avez appris à imposer votre volonté à vos réactions corporelles et mentales. Cette maîtrise renforce les Compétences qui reposent sur le contrôle conscient de soi.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Lors de l’acquisition, choisissez une Compétence de <strong>Discipline Mentale (Mental Discipline)</strong>. Vous gagnez <strong>+5 par Tier</strong> avec cette Compétence lorsque la maîtrise consciente de soi constitue bien l’objet de la Manœuvre.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Mind Over Matter","system":{"description":"<h1>Mind Over Matter</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You have learned to impose your will upon your bodily and mental reactions. This mastery strengthens Skills based on conscious self-control.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>When acquiring this Talent, choose one <strong>Mental Discipline</strong> Skill. You gain <strong>+5 per Tier</strong> with that Skill when conscious self-mastery is genuinely the purpose of the Maneuver.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Talents — Mentaux"],"en":["Talents — Mental"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["talents-mental"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Discipline","name":"Mind Over Matter","cost":"5/Tier","tier":0,"maxTier":3,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Mind Over Matter</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You have learned to impose your will upon your bodily and mental reactions. This mastery strengthens Skills based on conscious self-control.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>When acquiring this Talent, choose one <strong>Mental Discipline</strong> Skill. You gain <strong>+5 per Tier</strong> with that Skill when conscious self-mastery is genuinely the purpose of the Maneuver.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_mind-over-matter.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"EDExQpBkuNldZ6vG"}
{"name":"Natural Horseman","type":"talent","img":"icons/skills/movement/ball-spinning-blue.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"natural-horseman","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"talent","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"natural-horseman","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"talents-general","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Cavalier-né (Natural Horseman)","system":{"description":"<h1>Cavalier-né (Natural Horseman)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous avez une affinité instinctive avec les chevaux. Vous comprenez facilement leurs réactions, trouvez naturellement votre équilibre en selle et savez les guider avec une aisance supérieure à celle d’un cavalier ordinaire. Cette affinité améliore toutes les Manœuvres qui impliquent directement des chevaux.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Vous gagnez <strong>+5 par Tier</strong> aux Manœuvres d’Équitation et de manipulation d’animaux lorsqu’elles concernent directement un cheval. Le bonus ne s’étend pas automatiquement aux autres montures.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Natural Horseman","system":{"description":"<h1>Natural Horseman</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You have an instinctive affinity with horses. You easily understand their reactions, naturally find your balance in the saddle, and know how to guide them with greater ease than an ordinary rider. This affinity improves all Maneuvers that directly involve horses.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>You gain <strong>+5 per Tier</strong> to Riding and Animal Handling Maneuvers when they directly concern a horse. The bonus does not automatically extend to other mounts.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Talents — Généraux"],"en":["Talents — General"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["talents-general"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Other","name":"Natural Horseman","cost":"5/Tier","tier":0,"maxTier":3,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Natural Horseman</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You have an instinctive affinity with horses. You easily understand their reactions, naturally find your balance in the saddle, and know how to guide them with greater ease than an ordinary rider. This affinity improves all Maneuvers that directly involve horses.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>You gain <strong>+5 per Tier</strong> to Riding and Animal Handling Maneuvers when they directly concern a horse. The bonus does not automatically extend to other mounts.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_natural-horseman.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"cT7szF3G44rQO9Eg"}
{"name":"Natural Physique","type":"talent","img":"icons/skills/movement/ball-spinning-blue.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"natural-physique","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"talent","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"natural-physique","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"talents-general","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Physique naturel (Natural Physique)","system":{"description":"<h1>Physique naturel (Natural Physique)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Votre corps répond exceptionnellement bien au conditionnement physique. <strong>Développement Corporel (Body Development)</strong> vous vient particulièrement naturellement et peut être développé plus facilement que ne le permettrait normalement votre Profession.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>RMU n’utilise plus la classification Everyman de la même manière. Le Talent conserve donc son intention : <strong>Développement Corporel (Body Development)</strong> est traité comme particulièrement favorable pour le personnage. Tant qu’aucun mécanisme natif ne modifie son coût de développement, le MJ applique la réduction de coût prévue pour la campagne MERP-RMU.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Natural Physique","system":{"description":"<h1>Natural Physique</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Your body responds exceptionally well to physical conditioning. <strong>Body Development</strong> comes particularly naturally to you and can be developed more easily than your Profession would normally allow.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>RMU no longer uses the Everyman classification in the same way. The Talent therefore preserves its intent: <strong>Body Development</strong> is treated as especially favorable for the character. Until a native mechanism modifies its development cost, the GM applies the cost reduction established for the MERP-RMU campaign.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Talents — Généraux"],"en":["Talents — General"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["talents-general"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Physical","name":"Natural Physique","cost":"10","tier":0,"maxTier":1,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Natural Physique</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Your body responds exceptionally well to physical conditioning. <strong>Body Development</strong> comes particularly naturally to you and can be developed more easily than your Profession would normally allow.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>RMU no longer uses the Everyman classification in the same way. The Talent therefore preserves its intent: <strong>Body Development</strong> is treated as especially favorable for the character. Until a native mechanism modifies its development cost, the GM applies the cost reduction established for the MERP-RMU campaign.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_natural-physique.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"FaFEE2wYrlb80PBa"}
{"name":"Obsessive Greed","type":"talent","img":"icons/magic/movement/abstract-ribbons-red-orange.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"obsessive-greed","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"flaw","restrictions":{"races":["Khazâd","Naugrim"]},"descriptionVersion":3,"compendiumSourceKey":"obsessive-greed","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"flaws-mental","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Avarice obsessionnelle (Obsessive Greed)","system":{"description":"<h1>Avarice obsessionnelle (Obsessive Greed)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Votre goût pour les gemmes, les bijoux et les ouvrages magnifiques s’est transformé en compulsion. Vous cherchez à posséder ce que vous jugez particulièrement beau ou précieux, même lorsque cette obsession vous conduit à ignorer les conséquences.</p><p>Lorsqu’un objet de grande valeur matérielle ou émotionnelle devient accessible, le MJ peut demander une <strong>Manœuvre d’Autodiscipline</strong> pour y renoncer volontairement. La difficulté dépend de l’importance de l’objet et du prix à payer pour le posséder.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Obsessive Greed","system":{"description":"<h1>Obsessive Greed</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Your taste for gems, jewelry, and beautiful workmanship has become a compulsion. You seek to possess what you consider especially beautiful or valuable even when that obsession drives you to ignore the consequences.</p><p>When an object of great material or emotional value becomes accessible, the GM may require a <strong>Self Discipline Maneuver</strong> for you to willingly give it up. The difficulty depends on the importance of the object and the price required to possess it.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Défauts — Mentaux"],"en":["Flaws — Mental"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["flaws-mental"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Other","name":"Obsessive Greed","cost":"-10","tier":0,"maxTier":1,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Obsessive Greed</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Your taste for gems, jewelry, and beautiful workmanship has become a compulsion. You seek to possess what you consider especially beautiful or valuable even when that obsession drives you to ignore the consequences.</p><p>When an object of great material or emotional value becomes accessible, the GM may require a <strong>Self Discipline Maneuver</strong> for you to willingly give it up. The difficulty depends on the importance of the object and the price required to possess it.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_obsessive-greed.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"hrtQ57vstrg0C8qp"}
{"name":"One Arm","type":"talent","img":"icons/magic/movement/abstract-ribbons-red-orange.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"one-arm","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"flaw","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"one-arm","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"flaws-physical","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Un seul bras (One Arm)","system":{"description":"<h1>Un seul bras (One Arm)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous ne disposez que d’un seul bras fonctionnel, qu’il ait été perdu, paralysé ou rendu inutilisable. Les actions qui supposent normalement l’usage coordonné des deux bras sont impossibles ou nécessitent une adaptation spécifique.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Les armes, boucliers, escalades, manipulations et autres tâches sont résolus avec les règles RMU ordinaires en tenant compte de cette limitation. Une prothèse peut atténuer certaines conséquences si la technologie et le contexte de campagne le permettent, mais elle ne supprime pas automatiquement le Défaut.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"One Arm","system":{"description":"<h1>One Arm</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You have only one functional arm, whether the other was lost, paralyzed, or rendered unusable. Actions that normally require coordinated use of both arms are impossible or require a specific adaptation.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>Weapons, shields, climbing, manipulation, and other tasks are resolved using ordinary RMU rules while taking this limitation into account. A prosthesis may mitigate some consequences if the technology and campaign context allow it, but it does not automatically remove the Flaw.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Défauts — Physiques"],"en":["Flaws — Physical"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["flaws-physical"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Physical","name":"One Arm","cost":"-15","tier":0,"maxTier":1,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>One Arm</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You have only one functional arm, whether the other was lost, paralyzed, or rendered unusable. Actions that normally require coordinated use of both arms are impossible or require a specific adaptation.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>Weapons, shields, climbing, manipulation, and other tasks are resolved using ordinary RMU rules while taking this limitation into account. A prosthesis may mitigate some consequences if the technology and campaign context allow it, but it does not automatically remove the Flaw.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_one-arm.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"c7shYkFQrKdPGvcm"}
{"name":"Outdoorsman","type":"talent","img":"icons/skills/movement/ball-spinning-blue.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"outdoorsman","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"talent","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"outdoorsman","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"talents-general","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Homme des bois (Outdoorsman)","system":{"description":"<h1>Homme des bois (Outdoorsman)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous êtes particulièrement à l’aise dans les terres sauvages. Trouver de la nourriture, allumer un feu, repérer un abri, suivre une piste, chasser ou vous déplacer discrètement dans un environnement naturel vous vient plus facilement. Cette expérience vous avantage dans l’ensemble de ces activités de plein air.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Vous gagnez <strong>+5 par Tier</strong> aux Manœuvres de Survie et de Pistage en milieu naturel. Le MJ peut également appliquer ce bonus à une Manœuvre de Discrétion, de chasse, de recherche de nourriture ou d’abri lorsque l’environnement sauvage constitue réellement le cœur de l’action.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Outdoorsman","system":{"description":"<h1>Outdoorsman</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You are particularly at ease in the wilderness. Finding food, lighting a fire, locating shelter, following a trail, hunting, or moving quietly through a natural environment comes more easily to you. This experience gives you an advantage in all such outdoor activities.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>You gain <strong>+5 per Tier</strong> to Survival and Tracking Maneuvers in natural environments. The GM may also apply this bonus to a Stealth, hunting, foraging, or shelter-finding Maneuver when the wilderness itself is genuinely central to the action.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Talents — Généraux"],"en":["Talents — General"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["talents-general"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Other","name":"Outdoorsman","cost":"7/Tier","tier":0,"maxTier":3,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Outdoorsman</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You are particularly at ease in the wilderness. Finding food, lighting a fire, locating shelter, following a trail, hunting, or moving quietly through a natural environment comes more easily to you. This experience gives you an advantage in all such outdoor activities.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>You gain <strong>+5 per Tier</strong> to Survival and Tracking Maneuvers in natural environments. The GM may also apply this bonus to a Stealth, hunting, foraging, or shelter-finding Maneuver when the wilderness itself is genuinely central to the action.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_outdoorsman.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"oep0af8KVjV8BHyq"}
{"name":"Photographic Memory","type":"talent","img":"icons/skills/movement/ball-spinning-blue.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"photographic-memory","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"talent","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"photographic-memory","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"talents-mental","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Mémoire photographique (Photographic Memory)","system":{"description":"<h1>Mémoire photographique (Photographic Memory)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Votre mémoire peut conserver une quantité extraordinaire d’informations avec une grande précision. Tout ce que vous étudiez réellement pendant plus de quinze minutes peut être mémorisé avec une précision exceptionnelle : un livre entier peut ainsi être retenu si vous prenez le temps de le lire et de l’étudier. Un simple regard sur une page ne suffit pas.</p><p>Lorsqu’un souvenir étudié devait être rappelé, l’ancienne règle utilisait un jet ouvert fondé sur la Mémoire ; le résultat déterminait si l’information était restituée entièrement ou seulement en partie. Le Talent apportait également un bonus général aux connaissances.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>En MERP-RMU, l’exigence d’<strong>étude réelle</strong> est conservée. Pour un détail important, incomplet ou ancien, le MJ peut demander une Manœuvre de Mémoire ou de Connaissance appropriée ; un succès permet une restitution très précise. Le Talent n’accorde pas la compréhension automatique d’un texte ni une connaissance qui n’a jamais été étudiée.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Photographic Memory","system":{"description":"<h1>Photographic Memory</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Your memory can retain an extraordinary quantity of information with great precision. Anything you genuinely study for more than fifteen minutes can be memorized with exceptional accuracy: an entire book can therefore be retained if you take the time to read and study it. A mere glance at a page is not sufficient.</p><p>When studied information had to be recalled, the older rule used an open-ended roll based on Memory; the result determined whether the information was recovered completely or only in part. The Talent also provided a general bonus to knowledge.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>MERP-RMU preserves the requirement for <strong>genuine study</strong>. For an important, incomplete, or old detail, the GM may require an appropriate Memory or Lore Maneuver; success allows extremely precise recall. The Talent does not grant automatic understanding of a text or knowledge that was never studied.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Talents — Mentaux"],"en":["Talents — Mental"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["talents-mental"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Other","name":"Photographic Memory","cost":"10","tier":0,"maxTier":1,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Photographic Memory</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Your memory can retain an extraordinary quantity of information with great precision. Anything you genuinely study for more than fifteen minutes can be memorized with exceptional accuracy: an entire book can therefore be retained if you take the time to read and study it. A mere glance at a page is not sufficient.</p><p>When studied information had to be recalled, the older rule used an open-ended roll based on Memory; the result determined whether the information was recovered completely or only in part. The Talent also provided a general bonus to knowledge.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>MERP-RMU preserves the requirement for <strong>genuine study</strong>. For an important, incomplete, or old detail, the GM may require an appropriate Memory or Lore Maneuver; success allows extremely precise recall. The Talent does not grant automatic understanding of a text or knowledge that was never studied.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_photographic-memory.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"7HRQlCfN3TLK33He"}
{"name":"Poor Control","type":"talent","img":"icons/magic/movement/abstract-ribbons-red-orange.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"poor-control","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"flaw","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"poor-control","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"flaws-special","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Mauvais contrôle (Poor Control)","system":{"description":"<h1>Mauvais contrôle (Poor Control)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Votre magie est instable lorsqu’elle vous échappe. Lorsqu’un sort vous échappe, les conséquences ont tendance à être plus dangereuses que pour un lanceur de sorts ordinaire, particulièrement avec les sorts offensifs.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>En MERP-RMU, lorsqu’un <strong>Spell Casting Roll</strong> échoue et qu’un résultat de Fumble ou de complication est applicable, le MJ augmente la sévérité ou choisit une conséquence plus dangereuse que pour un lanceur de sorts ordinaire. Le Défaut ne provoque pas automatiquement un Fumble sur chaque simple échec si les règles RMU n’en prévoient aucun.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Poor Control","system":{"description":"<h1>Poor Control</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Your magic is unstable when it escapes your control. When a spell gets away from you, the consequences tend to be more dangerous than for an ordinary spell-user, especially with offensive spells.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>In MERP-RMU, when a <strong>Spell Casting Roll</strong> fails and a Fumble or complication result applies, the GM increases the severity or chooses a more dangerous consequence than for an ordinary spell-user. The Flaw does not automatically cause a Fumble on every simple failure if RMU rules do not call for one.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Défauts — Spéciaux"],"en":["Flaws — Special"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["flaws-special"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Magical","name":"Poor Control","cost":"-7","tier":0,"maxTier":1,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Poor Control</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Your magic is unstable when it escapes your control. When a spell gets away from you, the consequences tend to be more dangerous than for an ordinary spell-user, especially with offensive spells.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>In MERP-RMU, when a <strong>Spell Casting Roll</strong> fails and a Fumble or complication result applies, the GM increases the severity or chooses a more dangerous consequence than for an ordinary spell-user. The Flaw does not automatically cause a Fumble on every simple failure if RMU rules do not call for one.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_poor-control.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"L91ISWhaZXi3Sh9Y"}
{"name":"Portage Skills","type":"talent","img":"icons/skills/movement/ball-spinning-blue.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"portage-skills","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"talent","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"portage-skills","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"talents-general","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Portage (Portage Skills)","system":{"description":"<h1>Portage (Portage Skills)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous avez appris à répartir, sangler et porter efficacement une charge. Votre technique réduit fortement les pénalités liées à l’encombrement.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Le système d’encombrement de RMU étant différent, vous réduisez de <strong>25 %</strong> les pénalités d’Encombrement qui vous affectent. Cette réduction représente aussi bien la technique de portage que l’habitude de marcher chargé.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Portage Skills","system":{"description":"<h1>Portage Skills</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You have learned how to distribute, secure, and carry a load efficiently. Your technique greatly reduces penalties caused by encumbrance.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>Because RMU uses a different encumbrance system, you reduce the Encumbrance penalties affecting you by <strong>25%</strong>. This reduction represents both carrying technique and the habit of travelling under load.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Talents — Généraux"],"en":["Talents — General"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["talents-general"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Physical","name":"Portage Skills","cost":"5","tier":0,"maxTier":1,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Portage Skills</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You have learned how to distribute, secure, and carry a load efficiently. Your technique greatly reduces penalties caused by encumbrance.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>Because RMU uses a different encumbrance system, you reduce the Encumbrance penalties affecting you by <strong>25%</strong>. This reduction represents both carrying technique and the habit of travelling under load.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_portage-skills.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"3xwbeHDPEYDaOBks"}
{"name":"Power Blind","type":"talent","img":"icons/magic/movement/abstract-ribbons-red-orange.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"power-blind","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"flaw","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"power-blind","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"flaws-special","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Aveugle à la Puissance (Power Blind)","system":{"description":"<h1>Aveugle à la Puissance (Power Blind)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous êtes partiellement aveugle aux courants et manifestations de Puissance. Cette cécité à la Puissance rend plus difficile la perception et l’analyse des phénomènes magiques.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Vous subissez une pénalité de <strong>−10</strong> aux Manœuvres dont l’objet principal est de percevoir, ressentir ou analyser directement la Puissance magique. Les effets évidents aux sens ordinaires restent perceptibles normalement.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Power Blind","system":{"description":"<h1>Power Blind</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You are partially blind to currents and manifestations of Power. This blindness makes magical phenomena harder for you to perceive and analyze.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>You suffer a <strong>−10</strong> penalty to Maneuvers whose primary purpose is to perceive, sense, or directly analyze magical Power. Effects obvious to ordinary senses remain normally perceptible.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Défauts — Spéciaux"],"en":["Flaws — Special"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["flaws-special"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Magical","name":"Power Blind","cost":"-10","tier":0,"maxTier":1,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Power Blind</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You are partially blind to currents and manifestations of Power. This blindness makes magical phenomena harder for you to perceive and analyze.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>You suffer a <strong>−10</strong> penalty to Maneuvers whose primary purpose is to perceive, sense, or directly analyze magical Power. Effects obvious to ordinary senses remain normally perceptible.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_power-blind.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"7r2QTjVBjEaR7Mfi"}
{"name":"Power Drain","type":"talent","img":"icons/magic/movement/abstract-ribbons-red-orange.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"power-drain","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"flaw","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":3,"compendiumSourceKey":"power-drain","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"flaws-special","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Drain des objets de Pouvoir (Power Drain)","system":{"description":"<h1>Drain des objets de Pouvoir (Power Drain)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Les objets qui augmentent ou multiplient votre réserve de Pouvoir perdent une partie de leur efficacité entre vos mains. Tout <strong>spell adder</strong> que vous utilisez est réduit d’un cran, et tout <strong>multiplier</strong> voit son multiplicateur réduit d’un point.</p><p>Ainsi, un adder +3 fonctionne pour vous comme un +2, et un multiplicateur ×2 comme un ×1. L’objet retrouve immédiatement sa puissance normale lorsqu’il est utilisé par quelqu’un qui ne possède pas ce Défaut.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Cette règle s’applique aux objets RMU qui remplissent encore la fonction d’adders ou de multipliers, quelle que soit leur présentation exacte dans Treasure Law ou dans Foundry.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Power Drain","system":{"description":"<h1>Power Drain</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Items that increase or multiply your Power reserve lose part of their effectiveness in your hands. Any <strong>spell adder</strong> you use is reduced by one step, and any <strong>multiplier</strong> has its multiplier reduced by one.</p><p>Thus, a +3 adder functions for you as +2, and a ×2 multiplier as ×1. The item immediately returns to full power when used by someone who does not possess this Flaw.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>This rule applies to RMU items that still fulfill the function of adders or multipliers, regardless of their exact presentation in Treasure Law or Foundry.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Défauts — Spéciaux"],"en":["Flaws — Special"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["flaws-special"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Magical","name":"Power Drain","cost":"-20","tier":0,"maxTier":1,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Power Drain</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Items that increase or multiply your Power reserve lose part of their effectiveness in your hands. Any <strong>spell adder</strong> you use is reduced by one step, and any <strong>multiplier</strong> has its multiplier reduced by one.</p><p>Thus, a +3 adder functions for you as +2, and a ×2 multiplier as ×1. The item immediately returns to full power when used by someone who does not possess this Flaw.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>This rule applies to RMU items that still fulfill the function of adders or multipliers, regardless of their exact presentation in Treasure Law or Foundry.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_power-drain.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"Kl5bBKOZbHuGfmIX"}
{"name":"Power Leakage","type":"talent","img":"icons/magic/movement/abstract-ribbons-red-orange.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"power-leakage","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"flaw","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":3,"compendiumSourceKey":"power-leakage","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"flaws-special","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Fuite de Pouvoir (Power Leakage)","system":{"description":"<h1>Fuite de Pouvoir (Power Leakage)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous retenez difficilement l’énergie magique que vous développez. Votre réserve de Points de Pouvoir est systématiquement inférieure à celle d’un utilisateur de magie de compétence comparable.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Vous subissez <strong>−10 au bonus total de Développement de Pouvoir (Power Development)</strong> pour le calcul de votre réserve de Points de Pouvoir. Cette pénalité ne réduit pas vos rangs et n’affecte pas les autres usages éventuels de la Compétence.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Power Leakage","system":{"description":"<h1>Power Leakage</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You have difficulty retaining the magical energy you develop. Your Power Point reserve is consistently lower than that of a magic-user with comparable skill.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>You suffer <strong>−10 to your total Power Development bonus</strong> for calculating your Power Point reserve. This penalty does not reduce your ranks and does not affect any other possible uses of the Skill.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Défauts — Spéciaux"],"en":["Flaws — Special"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["flaws-special"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Magical","name":"Power Leakage","cost":"-20","tier":0,"maxTier":1,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Power Leakage</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You have difficulty retaining the magical energy you develop. Your Power Point reserve is consistently lower than that of a magic-user with comparable skill.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>You suffer <strong>−10 to your total Power Development bonus</strong> for calculating your Power Point reserve. This penalty does not reduce your ranks and does not affect any other possible uses of the Skill.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_power-leakage.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"blTHG2huxhDkPljS"}
{"name":"Repulsive Habit","type":"talent","img":"icons/magic/movement/abstract-ribbons-red-orange.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"repulsive-habit","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"flaw","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"repulsive-habit","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"flaws-special","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Habitude répugnante (Repulsive Habit)","system":{"description":"<h1>Habitude répugnante (Repulsive Habit)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous avez une habitude que la plupart des gens trouvent pénible ou répugnante et vous ressentez le besoin de vous y livrer chaque fois que l’occasion se présente. Selon le Tier, ce comportement va d’une habitude simplement agaçante à une conduite si dégoûtante qu’elle peut faire quitter la pièce aux témoins.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><ul><li><strong>Tier I :</strong> l’habitude agace et provoque le mépris.</li><li><strong>Tier II :</strong> elle dégoûte ouvertement la plupart des témoins.</li><li><strong>Tier III :</strong> elle provoque un rejet social immédiat et intense.</li></ul><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>L’habitude est choisie avec l’accord du MJ. Lorsqu’elle est connue ou observée, elle doit affecter les réactions sociales de manière proportionnée au Tier.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Repulsive Habit","system":{"description":"<h1>Repulsive Habit</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You have a habit most people find unpleasant or repulsive, and you feel compelled to indulge it whenever the opportunity arises. Depending on Tier, this behavior ranges from merely annoying to so disgusting that witnesses may leave the room.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><ul><li><strong>Tier I:</strong> the habit annoys others and provokes contempt.</li><li><strong>Tier II:</strong> it openly disgusts most witnesses.</li><li><strong>Tier III:</strong> it provokes immediate and intense social rejection.</li></ul><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The habit is chosen with the GM’s approval. When known or observed, it should affect social reactions in proportion to the Tier.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Défauts — Spéciaux"],"en":["Flaws — Special"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["flaws-special"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Other","name":"Repulsive Habit","cost":"-5/Tier","tier":0,"maxTier":3,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Repulsive Habit</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You have a habit most people find unpleasant or repulsive, and you feel compelled to indulge it whenever the opportunity arises. Depending on Tier, this behavior ranges from merely annoying to so disgusting that witnesses may leave the room.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><ul><li><strong>Tier I:</strong> the habit annoys others and provokes contempt.</li><li><strong>Tier II:</strong> it openly disgusts most witnesses.</li><li><strong>Tier III:</strong> it provokes immediate and intense social rejection.</li></ul><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The habit is chosen with the GM’s approval. When known or observed, it should affect social reactions in proportion to the Tier.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_repulsive-habit.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"XmFoVPxOvn4RZySF"}
{"name":"Resistance","type":"talent","img":"icons/skills/movement/ball-spinning-blue.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"resistance","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"talent","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"resistance","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"talents-mystical","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Résistance (Resistance)","system":{"description":"<h1>Résistance (Resistance)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous opposez à la magie une résistance innée supérieure à la normale. Cette aptitude est distincte de <em>Magical Resistance</em> et représente une résistance générale aux effets magiques.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Vous gagnez <strong>+5 par Tier</strong> aux Jets de Résistance contre les sorts. Cette version reste volontairement séparée de <em>Magical Resistance</em> du Core RMU et ne doit pas être interprétée comme une immunité à la magie.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Resistance","system":{"description":"<h1>Resistance</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You possess a greater-than-normal innate resistance to magic. This aptitude is distinct from <em>Magical Resistance</em> and represents general resistance to magical effects.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>You gain <strong>+5 per Tier</strong> to Resistance Rolls against spells. This version deliberately remains separate from the RMU Core <em>Magical Resistance</em> Talent and must not be interpreted as immunity to magic.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Talents — Mystiques"],"en":["Talents — Mystical"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["talents-mystical"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Magical","name":"Resistance","cost":"5/Tier","tier":0,"maxTier":3,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Resistance</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You possess a greater-than-normal innate resistance to magic. This aptitude is distinct from <em>Magical Resistance</em> and represents general resistance to magical effects.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>You gain <strong>+5 per Tier</strong> to Resistance Rolls against spells. This version deliberately remains separate from the RMU Core <em>Magical Resistance</em> Talent and must not be interpreted as immunity to magic.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_resistance.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"iWumP3TgiUdkL4qw"}
{"name":"Rival/NPC","type":"talent","img":"icons/magic/movement/abstract-ribbons-red-orange.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"rival-npc","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"flaw","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"rival-npc","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"flaws-special","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Rival — PNJ (Rival/NPC)","system":{"description":"<h1>Rival — PNJ (Rival/NPC)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous avez un rival qui poursuit ses propres objectifs et agit régulièrement contre vos intérêts. L’origine de la rivalité, ses enjeux et les limites que chacun est prêt à franchir sont définis avec le MJ.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><p>Le Tier mesure la puissance, les ressources, l’hostilité ou la fréquence d’intervention du rival.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Le rival doit être un véritable PNJ de campagne, capable d’intervenir dans l’histoire. Il n’est pas nécessaire qu’il cherche à vous tuer : concurrence, vengeance, prestige, politique ou intérêts opposés peuvent suffire.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Rival/NPC","system":{"description":"<h1>Rival/NPC</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You have a rival who pursues their own goals and regularly acts against your interests. The origin of the rivalry, its stakes, and the limits each side is willing to cross are defined with the GM.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><p>The Tier measures the rival’s power, resources, hostility, or frequency of intervention.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The rival must be a genuine campaign NPC capable of entering the story. They need not seek to kill you: competition, revenge, prestige, politics, or opposing interests may be sufficient.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Défauts — Spéciaux"],"en":["Flaws — Special"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["flaws-special"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Other","name":"Rival/NPC","cost":"-5/Tier","tier":0,"maxTier":3,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Rival/NPC</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You have a rival who pursues their own goals and regularly acts against your interests. The origin of the rivalry, its stakes, and the limits each side is willing to cross are defined with the GM.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><p>The Tier measures the rival’s power, resources, hostility, or frequency of intervention.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The rival must be a genuine campaign NPC capable of entering the story. They need not seek to kill you: competition, revenge, prestige, politics, or opposing interests may be sufficient.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_rival-npc.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"NieIzg5vjYXFTIoh"}
{"name":"Rival/PC","type":"talent","img":"icons/magic/movement/abstract-ribbons-red-orange.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"rival-pc","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"flaw","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"rival-pc","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"flaws-special","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Rival — PJ (Rival/PC)","system":{"description":"<h1>Rival — PJ (Rival/PC)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous entretenez une rivalité durable avec un autre personnage joueur. Cette rivalité peut porter sur le prestige, l’autorité, une idéologie, une personne, une dette ou toute autre source de conflit récurrent.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><p>Le Tier mesure l’intensité et les conséquences de la rivalité.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Ce Défaut ne doit être choisi qu’avec l’accord explicite des joueurs concernés. Il ne donne jamais permission de saboter la partie ou de retirer l’agence de l’autre joueur.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Rival/PC","system":{"description":"<h1>Rival/PC</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You maintain a lasting rivalry with another player character. The rivalry may concern prestige, authority, ideology, a person, a debt, or any other recurring source of conflict.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><p>The Tier measures the intensity and consequences of the rivalry.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>This Flaw should be chosen only with the explicit agreement of the players concerned. It never grants permission to sabotage the game or remove another player’s agency.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Défauts — Spéciaux"],"en":["Flaws — Special"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["flaws-special"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Other","name":"Rival/PC","cost":"-5/Tier","tier":0,"maxTier":3,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Rival/PC</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You maintain a lasting rivalry with another player character. The rivalry may concern prestige, authority, ideology, a person, a debt, or any other recurring source of conflict.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><p>The Tier measures the intensity and consequences of the rivalry.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>This Flaw should be chosen only with the explicit agreement of the players concerned. It never grants permission to sabotage the game or remove another player’s agency.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_rival-pc.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"IbAejcVguSQtMRas"}
{"name":"Secret Identity","type":"talent","img":"icons/magic/movement/abstract-ribbons-red-orange.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"secret-identity","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"flaw","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":3,"compendiumSourceKey":"secret-identity","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"flaws-special","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Identité secrète (Secret Identity)","system":{"description":"<h1>Identité secrète (Secret Identity)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous menez réellement une double vie. Votre identité publique et votre identité véritable doivent rester séparées, et certaines personnes ou organisations ont de bonnes raisons de chercher à découvrir qui vous êtes.</p><p>Le Défaut n’est valable que si cette dissimulation crée une contrainte réelle : prudence dans vos relations, nécessité de conserver une couverture, risque de perdre un statut ou d’attirer des ennemis si votre identité est révélée.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Ce Défaut est essentiellement narratif. Le MJ doit s’assurer qu’il existe effectivement un enjeu et au moins une faction ou un individu susceptible de rechercher la véritable identité du personnage.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Secret Identity","system":{"description":"<h1>Secret Identity</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You genuinely lead a double life. Your public identity and your true identity must remain separate, and certain people or organizations have good reason to discover who you really are.</p><p>The Flaw is valid only if this concealment creates a real constraint: caution in relationships, the need to maintain a cover, the risk of losing status, or attracting enemies if your identity is revealed.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>This Flaw is primarily narrative. The GM must ensure that a genuine stake exists and that at least one faction or individual is capable of seeking the character’s true identity.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Défauts — Spéciaux"],"en":["Flaws — Special"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["flaws-special"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Other","name":"Secret Identity","cost":"-10","tier":0,"maxTier":1,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Secret Identity</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You genuinely lead a double life. Your public identity and your true identity must remain separate, and certain people or organizations have good reason to discover who you really are.</p><p>The Flaw is valid only if this concealment creates a real constraint: caution in relationships, the need to maintain a cover, the risk of losing status, or attracting enemies if your identity is revealed.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>This Flaw is primarily narrative. The GM must ensure that a genuine stake exists and that at least one faction or individual is capable of seeking the character’s true identity.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_secret-identity.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"07G5ieHjeJkVqER1"}
{"name":"Secret","type":"talent","img":"icons/magic/movement/abstract-ribbons-red-orange.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"secret","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"flaw","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"secret","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"flaws-special","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Secret (Secret)","system":{"description":"<h1>Secret (Secret)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous dissimulez une information qui pourrait vous nuire si elle était révélée : acte passé, origine, dette, affiliation, crime, faute, relation ou connaissance interdite.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><ul><li><strong>Tier I :</strong> révélation embarrassante ou localement dommageable.</li><li><strong>Tier II :</strong> conséquences graves sur votre statut, vos relations ou votre sécurité.</li><li><strong>Tier III :</strong> révélation susceptible de détruire votre position, provoquer une poursuite ou mettre directement votre vie en danger.</li></ul><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Le secret doit pouvoir être découvert dans la campagne. Un secret sans conséquence ou impossible à révéler ne justifie pas le Défaut.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Secret","system":{"description":"<h1>Secret</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You conceal information that could harm you if revealed: a past act, origin, debt, affiliation, crime, failing, relationship, or forbidden knowledge.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><ul><li><strong>Tier I:</strong> an embarrassing or locally damaging revelation.</li><li><strong>Tier II:</strong> serious consequences for your status, relationships, or safety.</li><li><strong>Tier III:</strong> a revelation capable of destroying your position, provoking pursuit, or directly endangering your life.</li></ul><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The secret must be discoverable during the campaign. A secret with no consequences or no possibility of being revealed does not justify the Flaw.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Défauts — Spéciaux"],"en":["Flaws — Special"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["flaws-special"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Other","name":"Secret","cost":"-5/Tier","tier":0,"maxTier":3,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Secret</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You conceal information that could harm you if revealed: a past act, origin, debt, affiliation, crime, failing, relationship, or forbidden knowledge.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><ul><li><strong>Tier I:</strong> an embarrassing or locally damaging revelation.</li><li><strong>Tier II:</strong> serious consequences for your status, relationships, or safety.</li><li><strong>Tier III:</strong> a revelation capable of destroying your position, provoking pursuit, or directly endangering your life.</li></ul><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The secret must be discoverable during the campaign. A secret with no consequences or no possibility of being revealed does not justify the Flaw.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_secret.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"RigK5rWWHJ3bLBDU"}
{"name":"Sense of Duty","type":"talent","img":"icons/magic/movement/abstract-ribbons-red-orange.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"sense-of-duty","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"flaw","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"sense-of-duty","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"flaws-mental","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Sens du devoir (Sense of Duty)","system":{"description":"<h1>Sens du devoir (Sense of Duty)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous ressentez personnellement une responsabilité profonde envers quelqu’un ou quelque chose. Contrairement à <em>Duty</em>, cette obligation vient de vous-même : vous ne trahirez, ne blesserez ni ne tromperez volontairement ceux envers qui vous éprouvez ce devoir.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><ul><li><strong>Tier I :</strong> devoir envers une personne proche ou un petit groupe.</li><li><strong>Tier II :</strong> devoir envers un grand groupe ou une organisation, comme une ville.</li><li><strong>Tier III :</strong> devoir envers un pays, un peuple ou une cause d’ampleur comparable.</li></ul><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>L’étendue du devoir augmente avec le Tier. Le MJ doit pouvoir s’en servir pour créer de véritables choix et obligations en jeu.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Sense of Duty","system":{"description":"<h1>Sense of Duty</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You personally feel a deep responsibility toward someone or something. Unlike <em>Duty</em>, this obligation comes from within: you will not willingly betray, harm, or deceive those toward whom you feel this duty.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><ul><li><strong>Tier I:</strong> duty toward one close person or a small group.</li><li><strong>Tier II:</strong> duty toward a large group or organization, such as a city.</li><li><strong>Tier III:</strong> duty toward a country, a people, or a cause of comparable scope.</li></ul><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The scope of the duty increases with Tier. The GM must be able to use it to create genuine choices and obligations in play.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Défauts — Mentaux"],"en":["Flaws — Mental"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["flaws-mental"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Other","name":"Sense of Duty","cost":"-5/Tier","tier":0,"maxTier":3,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Sense of Duty</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You personally feel a deep responsibility toward someone or something. Unlike <em>Duty</em>, this obligation comes from within: you will not willingly betray, harm, or deceive those toward whom you feel this duty.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><ul><li><strong>Tier I:</strong> duty toward one close person or a small group.</li><li><strong>Tier II:</strong> duty toward a large group or organization, such as a city.</li><li><strong>Tier III:</strong> duty toward a country, a people, or a cause of comparable scope.</li></ul><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The scope of the duty increases with Tier. The GM must be able to use it to create genuine choices and obligations in play.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_sense-of-duty.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"Wod7cAjAP3qxSShy"}
{"name":"Shadow-sight","type":"talent","img":"icons/skills/movement/ball-spinning-blue.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"shadow-sight","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"talent","restrictions":{"cultures":["Hommes du Nord urbanisés","Urban Northmen","Gramuz","Éothraim","Eothraim","Béornides","Berninga"]},"descriptionVersion":3,"compendiumSourceKey":"shadow-sight","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"talents-cultural","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Vision de l’Ombre (Shadow-sight)","system":{"description":"<h1>Vision de l’Ombre (Shadow-sight)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous voyez les fantômes, les spectres et les autres habitants du monde de l’Ombre comme s’ils étaient normalement visibles. Cette perception révèle leur présence lorsqu’ils occupent le même espace que le monde visible, sans vous permettre de voir à travers les obstacles ni d’annuler d’autres formes de dissimulation.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Cette faculté reste un Talent binaire : elle permet de percevoir normalement les créatures du monde de l’Ombre lorsqu’elles sont présentes et visibles depuis votre position. Elle ne fournit aucun bonus automatique de Perception contre des créatures cachées ou invisibles par d’autres moyens.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Shadow-sight","system":{"description":"<h1>Shadow-sight</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You can see ghosts, wraiths, and other inhabitants of the Shadow World as though they were normally visible. This perception reveals their presence when they occupy the same space as the visible world without allowing you to see through obstacles or negate other forms of concealment.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>This ability remains a binary Talent: it allows you to perceive creatures of the Shadow World normally when they are present and visible from your position. It grants no automatic Perception bonus against creatures hidden or invisible by other means.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Talents — Culturels"],"en":["Talents — Cultural"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["talents-cultural"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Senses","name":"Shadow-sight","cost":"10","tier":0,"maxTier":1,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Shadow-sight</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You can see ghosts, wraiths, and other inhabitants of the Shadow World as though they were normally visible. This perception reveals their presence when they occupy the same space as the visible world without allowing you to see through obstacles or negate other forms of concealment.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>This ability remains a binary Talent: it allows you to perceive creatures of the Shadow World normally when they are present and visible from your position. It grants no automatic Perception bonus against creatures hidden or invisible by other means.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_shadow-sight.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"bMcd65nej5e9C4mj"}
{"name":"Short of Breath","type":"talent","img":"icons/magic/movement/abstract-ribbons-red-orange.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"short-of-breath","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"flaw","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"short-of-breath","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"flaws-physical","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Essoufflement (Short of Breath)","system":{"description":"<h1>Essoufflement (Short of Breath)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Votre capacité respiratoire est limitée. Les efforts prolongés, la course, l’escalade, le combat soutenu et toute activité exigeant une forte dépense d’énergie vous épuisent plus rapidement que la normale. Les différents Tiers représentent une gêne respiratoire de plus en plus importante.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><p>Chaque Tier augmente la fréquence et la gravité des conséquences lors d’efforts physiques soutenus.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>RMU gérant l’effort avec ses propres règles d’Endurance et de Points d’Action, le MJ applique le Tier comme modificateur défavorable aux Jets d’Endurance ou comme augmentation raisonnable du coût de l’effort lorsque la respiration est déterminante.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Short of Breath","system":{"description":"<h1>Short of Breath</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Your breathing capacity is limited. Prolonged exertion, running, climbing, sustained combat, and any activity requiring heavy energy expenditure exhaust you more quickly than normal. The different Tiers represent increasingly severe respiratory impairment.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><p>Each Tier increases the frequency and severity of consequences during sustained physical exertion.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>Because RMU handles exertion through its own Endurance and Action Point rules, the GM applies the Tier as an unfavorable modifier to Endurance Rolls or as a reasonable increase in the cost of exertion whenever breathing capacity is decisive.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Défauts — Physiques"],"en":["Flaws — Physical"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["flaws-physical"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Physical","name":"Short of Breath","cost":"-5/Tier","tier":0,"maxTier":3,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Short of Breath</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Your breathing capacity is limited. Prolonged exertion, running, climbing, sustained combat, and any activity requiring heavy energy expenditure exhaust you more quickly than normal. The different Tiers represent increasingly severe respiratory impairment.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><p>Each Tier increases the frequency and severity of consequences during sustained physical exertion.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>Because RMU handles exertion through its own Endurance and Action Point rules, the GM applies the Tier as an unfavorable modifier to Endurance Rolls or as a reasonable increase in the cost of exertion whenever breathing capacity is decisive.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_short-of-breath.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"OszT5jBy3QNxhrlR"}
{"name":"Speed Reading","type":"talent","img":"icons/skills/movement/ball-spinning-blue.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"speed-reading","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"talent","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"speed-reading","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"talents-mental","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Lecture rapide (Speed Reading)","system":{"description":"<h1>Lecture rapide (Speed Reading)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous avez appris à parcourir très rapidement un texte sans perdre sa compréhension générale. Vous pouvez lire livres, cartes et autres documents à environ <strong>dix pages par minute</strong> dans de bonnes conditions.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Cette cadence est conservée dans des conditions normales de lecture. Un texte codé, abîmé, particulièrement technique, écrit dans une langue mal maîtrisée ou exigeant une étude approfondie peut réduire cette vitesse ou nécessiter une Manœuvre appropriée.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Speed Reading","system":{"description":"<h1>Speed Reading</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You have learned to read text very quickly without losing its general meaning. Under good conditions, you can read books, maps, and other documents at about <strong>ten pages per minute</strong>.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>This rate is retained under normal reading conditions. Encoded, damaged, highly technical text, text written in a poorly mastered language, or material requiring deep study may reduce this speed or require an appropriate Maneuver.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Talents — Mentaux"],"en":["Talents — Mental"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["talents-mental"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Other","name":"Speed Reading","cost":"5","tier":0,"maxTier":1,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Speed Reading</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You have learned to read text very quickly without losing its general meaning. Under good conditions, you can read books, maps, and other documents at about <strong>ten pages per minute</strong>.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>This rate is retained under normal reading conditions. Encoded, damaged, highly technical text, text written in a poorly mastered language, or material requiring deep study may reduce this speed or require an appropriate Maneuver.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_speed-reading.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"m2BZeiSEPoJfBsYL"}
{"name":"Stealthy","type":"talent","img":"icons/skills/movement/ball-spinning-blue.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"stealthy-hobbit","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"talent","restrictions":{"races":["Hobbits","Periannath"]},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"stealthy-hobbit","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"talents-cultural","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Furtif (Stealthy)","system":{"description":"<h1>Furtif (Stealthy)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous incarnez la discrétion presque proverbiale des Hobbits : démarche silencieuse, capacité à vous fondre dans un environnement et talent pour disparaître de l’attention d’autrui. Cette aptitude améliore la filature, la dissimulation et les tentatives pour passer inaperçu au milieu d’autres personnes.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Vous gagnez <strong>+5 par Tier</strong> aux Manœuvres de Discrétion et aux Manœuvres appropriées pour passer inaperçu dans une foule ou un groupe. Ce Talent est réservé aux Hobbits.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Stealthy","system":{"description":"<h1>Stealthy</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You embody the almost proverbial stealth of Hobbits: a quiet gait, the ability to blend into your surroundings, and a talent for slipping from the notice of others. This aptitude improves shadowing, concealment, and attempts to pass unnoticed among other people.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>You gain <strong>+5 per Tier</strong> to Stealth Maneuvers and appropriate Maneuvers to pass unnoticed in a crowd or group. This Talent is restricted to Hobbits.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Talents — Culturels"],"en":["Talents — Cultural"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["talents-cultural"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Racial","name":"Stealthy","cost":"7/Tier","tier":0,"maxTier":3,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Stealthy</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You embody the almost proverbial stealth of Hobbits: a quiet gait, the ability to blend into your surroundings, and a talent for slipping from the notice of others. This aptitude improves shadowing, concealment, and attempts to pass unnoticed among other people.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>You gain <strong>+5 per Tier</strong> to Stealth Maneuvers and appropriate Maneuvers to pass unnoticed in a crowd or group. This Talent is restricted to Hobbits.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_stealthy-hobbit.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"8ix2UMGK2Nu6ZqHz"}
{"name":"Sun-hater","type":"talent","img":"icons/magic/movement/abstract-ribbons-red-orange.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"sun-hater","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"flaw","restrictions":{"cultures":["Olog-hai","Olog Hai","Demi-Trolls","Demi-Troll","Half-trolls","Half-Trolls"]},"descriptionVersion":3,"compendiumSourceKey":"sun-hater","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"flaws-physical","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Aversion au Soleil (Sun-hater)","system":{"description":"<h1>Aversion au Soleil (Sun-hater)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>La lumière solaire directe vous affaiblit profondément. En plein soleil, vous subissez <strong>−30</strong> à vos Manœuvres et attaques. Sous une lumière artificielle ou magique particulièrement vive, la pénalité est de <strong>−15</strong>.</p><p>Après votre retour dans l’obscurité ou sous une lumière normale, la pénalité persiste pendant <strong>1 round par tranche de 5 rounds d’exposition</strong>, jusqu’à un maximum de six heures pour une exposition prolongée.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Les anciens pourcentages d’activité sont remplacés par des modificateurs directs compatibles avec les Manœuvres et attaques RMU.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Sun-hater","system":{"description":"<h1>Sun-hater</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Direct sunlight profoundly weakens you. In full sunlight, you suffer <strong>−30</strong> to Maneuvers and attacks. Under especially bright artificial or magical light, the penalty is <strong>−15</strong>.</p><p>After returning to darkness or normal light, the penalty persists for <strong>1 round per 5 rounds of exposure</strong>, up to a maximum of six hours after prolonged exposure.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The old activity percentages are replaced by direct modifiers compatible with RMU Maneuvers and attacks.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Défauts — Physiques"],"en":["Flaws — Physical"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["flaws-physical"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Physical","name":"Sun-hater","cost":"-15","tier":0,"maxTier":1,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Sun-hater</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Direct sunlight profoundly weakens you. In full sunlight, you suffer <strong>−30</strong> to Maneuvers and attacks. Under especially bright artificial or magical light, the penalty is <strong>−15</strong>.</p><p>After returning to darkness or normal light, the penalty persists for <strong>1 round per 5 rounds of exposure</strong>, up to a maximum of six hours after prolonged exposure.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The old activity percentages are replaced by direct modifiers compatible with RMU Maneuvers and attacks.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_sun-hater.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"68KNhP6B2bKZ41Zd"}
{"name":"Telekinesis","type":"talent","img":"icons/skills/movement/ball-spinning-blue.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"telekinesis","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"talent","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"telekinesis","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"talents-mental","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Télékinésie (Telekinesis)","system":{"description":"<h1>Télékinésie (Telekinesis)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous pouvez déplacer un objet à distance par la seule force de votre esprit. Vous déplacez lentement des objets à distance par la seule force de votre esprit ; la masse manipulable et l’effort requis dépendent de votre maîtrise du Talent.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Pour éviter de concurrencer directement les sorts de Télékinésie de RMU, la puissance est répartie en <strong>trois Tiers</strong>. Le Tier I agit sur des objets très légers, le Tier II sur quelques kilogrammes et le Tier III sur une charge significative. La vitesse reste lente et le pouvoir exige concentration ; il ne permet pas de produire gratuitement les effets offensifs d’un sort de projection. Le MJ fixe la difficulté selon masse, distance et précision.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Telekinesis","system":{"description":"<h1>Telekinesis</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You can move an object at a distance by the power of your mind alone. You move objects slowly at range through mental force; the mass that can be manipulated and the effort required depend on your mastery of the Talent.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>To avoid directly competing with RMU Telekinesis spells, power is divided into <strong>three Tiers</strong>. Tier I affects very light objects, Tier II objects weighing a few kilograms, and Tier III a significant load. Movement remains slow and requires concentration; the power cannot freely reproduce the offensive effects of a projection spell. The GM sets the difficulty according to mass, distance, and precision.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Talents — Mentaux"],"en":["Talents — Mental"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["talents-mental"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Magical","name":"Telekinesis","cost":"10/Tier","tier":0,"maxTier":3,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Telekinesis</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You can move an object at a distance by the power of your mind alone. You move objects slowly at range through mental force; the mass that can be manipulated and the effort required depend on your mastery of the Talent.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>To avoid directly competing with RMU Telekinesis spells, power is divided into <strong>three Tiers</strong>. Tier I affects very light objects, Tier II objects weighing a few kilograms, and Tier III a significant load. Movement remains slow and requires concentration; the power cannot freely reproduce the offensive effects of a projection spell. The GM sets the difficulty according to mass, distance, and precision.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_telekinesis.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"8lCqR8udF6bJmAC0"}
{"name":"Telepathy","type":"talent","img":"icons/skills/movement/ball-spinning-blue.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"telepathy","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"talent","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"telepathy","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"talents-mental","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Télépathie (Telepathy)","system":{"description":"<h1>Télépathie (Telepathy)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous pouvez transmettre des pensées ou tenter de lire celles d’autrui. Une cible non consentante bénéficie d’un Jet de Résistance de Mentalisme. En cas d’échec, vous pouvez percevoir ses pensées de surface ; rechercher une information précise ou un secret profondément enfoui rend la tentative plus difficile. La portée et la profondeur du contact dépendent de votre Tier.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p><strong>Tier I :</strong> échange volontaire de pensées à courte portée. <strong>Tier II :</strong> portée et richesse de l’échange augmentées. <strong>Tier III :</strong> vous pouvez tenter de sonder une cible non consentante ; celle-ci bénéficie d’un Jet de Résistance de Mentalisme et les secrets profondément enfouis peuvent recevoir des bonus de résistance supplémentaires. Le Talent n’offre jamais un accès automatique à l’ensemble de la mémoire d’une cible.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Telepathy","system":{"description":"<h1>Telepathy</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You can transmit thoughts or attempt to read those of another. An unwilling target receives a Mentalism Resistance Roll. On a failure, you may perceive surface thoughts; seeking a specific piece of information or a deeply buried secret makes the attempt more difficult. The range and depth of contact depend on your Tier.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p><strong>Tier I:</strong> voluntary exchange of thoughts at short range. <strong>Tier II:</strong> increased range and richness of exchange. <strong>Tier III:</strong> you may attempt to probe an unwilling target; it receives a Mentalism Resistance Roll, and deeply buried secrets may gain additional resistance bonuses. The Talent never grants automatic access to a target’s entire memory.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Talents — Mentaux"],"en":["Talents — Mental"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["talents-mental"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Magical","name":"Telepathy","cost":"10/Tier","tier":0,"maxTier":3,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Telepathy</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You can transmit thoughts or attempt to read those of another. An unwilling target receives a Mentalism Resistance Roll. On a failure, you may perceive surface thoughts; seeking a specific piece of information or a deeply buried secret makes the attempt more difficult. The range and depth of contact depend on your Tier.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p><strong>Tier I:</strong> voluntary exchange of thoughts at short range. <strong>Tier II:</strong> increased range and richness of exchange. <strong>Tier III:</strong> you may attempt to probe an unwilling target; it receives a Mentalism Resistance Roll, and deeply buried secrets may gain additional resistance bonuses. The Talent never grants automatic access to a target’s entire memory.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_telepathy.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"FgMHCK8tTXVwJdV7"}
{"name":"Tenderfoot","type":"talent","img":"icons/magic/movement/abstract-ribbons-red-orange.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"tenderfoot","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"flaw","restrictions":{"races":["Hobbits","Periannath"]},"descriptionVersion":3,"compendiumSourceKey":"tenderfoot","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"flaws-physical","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Pieds sensibles (Tenderfoot)","system":{"description":"<h1>Pieds sensibles (Tenderfoot)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vos pieds sont exceptionnellement sensibles et presque dépourvus de la protection naturelle commune à votre peuple. Vous devez porter des chaussures, des bottes ou des sandales adaptées.</p><p>Lorsque vous êtes pieds nus sur un terrain susceptible de les blesser — pierre, gravier, ronces, neige dure, débris ou surface équivalente — vous subissez <strong>−25 aux Manœuvres de déplacement</strong>.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>La pénalité est réduite par rapport à la version d’origine afin de rester compatible avec l’échelle des modificateurs RMU, tout en conservant une contrainte réelle tant que vos pieds ne sont pas protégés.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Tenderfoot","system":{"description":"<h1>Tenderfoot</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Your feet are exceptionally sensitive and almost entirely lack the natural protection common to your people. You must wear suitable shoes, boots, or sandals.</p><p>When barefoot on terrain liable to injure them—stone, gravel, brambles, hard snow, debris, or an equivalent surface—you suffer <strong>−25 to movement Maneuvers</strong>.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The penalty is reduced from the original version to remain compatible with RMU modifier scales while preserving a genuine limitation whenever your feet are unprotected.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Défauts — Physiques"],"en":["Flaws — Physical"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["flaws-physical"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Physical","name":"Tenderfoot","cost":"-5","tier":0,"maxTier":1,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Tenderfoot</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Your feet are exceptionally sensitive and almost entirely lack the natural protection common to your people. You must wear suitable shoes, boots, or sandals.</p><p>When barefoot on terrain liable to injure them—stone, gravel, brambles, hard snow, debris, or an equivalent surface—you suffer <strong>−25 to movement Maneuvers</strong>.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The penalty is reduced from the original version to remain compatible with RMU modifier scales while preserving a genuine limitation whenever your feet are unprotected.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_tenderfoot.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"LU6hmGB3mhIF3mGN"}
{"name":"Terrible Luck","type":"talent","img":"icons/magic/movement/abstract-ribbons-red-orange.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"terrible-luck","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"flaw","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":3,"compendiumSourceKey":"terrible-luck","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"flaws-special","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Malchance funeste (Terrible Luck)","system":{"description":"<h1>Malchance funeste (Terrible Luck)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Lorsque vous obtenez un <strong>01 naturel</strong> sur une action, les circonstances se retournent contre vous de la façon la plus complète possible. L’action échoue, l’équipement utilisé peut se briser, vous pouvez chuter, vous blesser ou provoquer une autre complication majeure appropriée à la scène.</p><p>La conséquence peut être extrêmement grave, mais elle ne doit jamais être <strong>instantanément fatale</strong>. Même dans le pire des cas, il doit subsister une possibilité, aussi mince soit-elle, de survivre aux conséquences.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Le déclenchement repose sur un 01 naturel lorsque ce résultat est pertinent pour l’action effectuée. Le MJ choisit une complication cohérente avec la situation ; ce Défaut ne remplace pas les procédures normales de Fumble lorsqu’elles produisent déjà un résultat plus précis.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Terrible Luck","system":{"description":"<h1>Terrible Luck</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Whenever you roll a <strong>natural 01</strong> on an action, circumstances turn against you as completely as possible. The action fails, the equipment being used may break, you may fall, suffer an injury, or cause another major complication appropriate to the scene.</p><p>The consequence may be extremely severe, but it must never be <strong>instantly fatal</strong>. Even in the worst case, there must remain some possibility, however slight, of surviving the consequences.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The trigger is a natural 01 whenever that result is relevant to the action being attempted. The GM chooses a complication appropriate to the situation; this Flaw does not replace normal Fumble procedures when they already produce a more precise result.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Défauts — Spéciaux"],"en":["Flaws — Special"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["flaws-special"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Other","name":"Terrible Luck","cost":"-10","tier":0,"maxTier":1,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Terrible Luck</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Whenever you roll a <strong>natural 01</strong> on an action, circumstances turn against you as completely as possible. The action fails, the equipment being used may break, you may fall, suffer an injury, or cause another major complication appropriate to the scene.</p><p>The consequence may be extremely severe, but it must never be <strong>instantly fatal</strong>. Even in the worst case, there must remain some possibility, however slight, of surviving the consequences.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The trigger is a natural 01 whenever that result is relevant to the action being attempted. The GM chooses a complication appropriate to the situation; this Flaw does not replace normal Fumble procedures when they already produce a more precise result.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_terrible-luck.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"uX7o9nolbLi5J53s"}
{"name":"The Slain","type":"talent","img":"icons/magic/movement/abstract-ribbons-red-orange.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"the-slain","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"flaw","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":3,"compendiumSourceKey":"the-slain","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"flaws-special","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Proie désignée (The Slain)","system":{"description":"<h1>Proie désignée (The Slain)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous présentez une vulnérabilité particulière à une race déterminée. Le <strong>MJ choisit cette race</strong> lors de l’acquisition du Défaut ; elle ne peut pas être la race de votre propre personnage. Vous pouvez être vulnérable à une race apparentée à la vôtre, comme un Elfe vis-à-vis des Demi-Elfes.</p><p>Chaque fois qu’un membre de cette race vous inflige un <strong>Critique</strong>, celui-ci est résolu comme un <strong>Critique de Pourfendeur (Slaying Critical)</strong>. Cette faiblesse ne dépend ni de l’arme ni de l’attaque employée : c’est l’identité de l’attaquant qui rend le Critique particulièrement meurtrier.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>RMU conservant les Critiques de Pourfendeur, aucune conversion mécanique supplémentaire n’est nécessaire. La race choisie doit être notée lors de l’acquisition du Défaut.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"The Slain","system":{"description":"<h1>The Slain</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You possess a particular vulnerability to a chosen race. The <strong>GM chooses that race</strong> when the Flaw is acquired; it cannot be your own race. You may be vulnerable to a race related to your own, such as an Elf being vulnerable to Half-elves.</p><p>Whenever a member of that race inflicts a <strong>Critical</strong> on you, it is resolved as a <strong>Slaying Critical</strong>. This weakness does not depend on the weapon or attack used: it is the attacker’s identity that makes the Critical especially deadly.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>Because RMU retains Slaying Criticals, no additional mechanical conversion is required. The chosen race must be recorded when the Flaw is acquired.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Défauts — Spéciaux"],"en":["Flaws — Special"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["flaws-special"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Other","name":"The Slain","cost":"-20","tier":0,"maxTier":1,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>The Slain</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You possess a particular vulnerability to a chosen race. The <strong>GM chooses that race</strong> when the Flaw is acquired; it cannot be your own race. You may be vulnerable to a race related to your own, such as an Elf being vulnerable to Half-elves.</p><p>Whenever a member of that race inflicts a <strong>Critical</strong> on you, it is resolved as a <strong>Slaying Critical</strong>. This weakness does not depend on the weapon or attack used: it is the attacker’s identity that makes the Critical especially deadly.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>Because RMU retains Slaying Criticals, no additional mechanical conversion is required. The chosen race must be recorded when the Flaw is acquired.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_the-slain.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"LFFvpCXuHwQZrIRU"}
{"name":"Total Recall","type":"talent","img":"icons/skills/movement/ball-spinning-blue.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"total-recall","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"talent","restrictions":{"cultures":["Noldor"]},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"total-recall","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"talents-cultural","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Mémoire totale (Total Recall)","system":{"description":"<h1>Mémoire totale (Total Recall)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Votre mémoire est remarquable, même selon les standards des Eldar. Dans la source consacrée aux Noldor, <em>Total Recall</em> accordait un très important bonus à Mnemonics ainsi qu’un léger accroissement du bonus de Mémoire.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>En MERP-RMU, ce Talent représente une faculté exceptionnelle de rappel fidèle des expériences et connaissances réellement acquises. Le MJ peut accorder un avantage ou un bonus circonstanciel approprié aux Manœuvres de Mémoire lorsqu’il s’agit de restituer une information déjà apprise. Le Talent est réservé aux contextes raciaux/culturels prévus.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Total Recall","system":{"description":"<h1>Total Recall</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Your memory is remarkable even by Eldarin standards. In the source material devoted to the Noldor, <em>Total Recall</em> granted a very large bonus to Mnemonics as well as a small increase to the Memory bonus.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>In MERP-RMU, this Talent represents an exceptional ability to faithfully recall experiences and knowledge actually acquired. The GM may grant an advantage or appropriate situational bonus to Memory Maneuvers when recalling information already learned. The Talent is restricted to the racial and cultural contexts for which it is intended.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Talents — Culturels"],"en":["Talents — Cultural"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["talents-cultural"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Other","name":"Total Recall","cost":"10","tier":0,"maxTier":1,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Total Recall</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Your memory is remarkable even by Eldarin standards. In the source material devoted to the Noldor, <em>Total Recall</em> granted a very large bonus to Mnemonics as well as a small increase to the Memory bonus.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>In MERP-RMU, this Talent represents an exceptional ability to faithfully recall experiences and knowledge actually acquired. The GM may grant an advantage or appropriate situational bonus to Memory Maneuvers when recalling information already learned. The Talent is restricted to the racial and cultural contexts for which it is intended.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_total-recall.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"QMdWOm4jr8IEHcVo"}
{"name":"Trap Sense","type":"talent","img":"icons/skills/movement/ball-spinning-blue.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"trap-sense","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"talent","restrictions":{"races":["Khazâd","Naugrim"]},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"trap-sense","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"talents-cultural","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Sens des pièges (Trap Sense)","system":{"description":"<h1>Sens des pièges (Trap Sense)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous possédez une intuition particulière pour la présence des pièges mécaniques. Même sans recherche active, votre intuition peut vous avertir de la présence d’un piège mécanique que vous pourriez raisonnablement pressentir.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>En RMU, le pourcentage fixe est remplacé par un <strong>jet secret de Perception</strong> effectué par le MJ lorsqu’un piège mécanique pourrait raisonnablement provoquer cette intuition. Un succès signale qu’un danger mécanique est présent, sans nécessairement révéler son emplacement exact ni son fonctionnement.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Trap Sense","system":{"description":"<h1>Trap Sense</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You possess a particular intuition for the presence of mechanical traps. Even without actively searching, your intuition may warn you of a mechanical trap that you could reasonably sense.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>In RMU, the fixed percentage is replaced by a <strong>secret Perception roll</strong> made by the GM when a mechanical trap could reasonably trigger this intuition. Success indicates that a mechanical danger is present without necessarily revealing its exact location or operation.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Talents — Culturels"],"en":["Talents — Cultural"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["talents-cultural"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Racial","name":"Trap Sense","cost":"10","tier":0,"maxTier":1,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Trap Sense</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You possess a particular intuition for the presence of mechanical traps. Even without actively searching, your intuition may warn you of a mechanical trap that you could reasonably sense.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>In RMU, the fixed percentage is replaced by a <strong>secret Perception roll</strong> made by the GM when a mechanical trap could reasonably trigger this intuition. Success indicates that a mechanical danger is present without necessarily revealing its exact location or operation.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_trap-sense.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"NSyRaSdsf3CXBrTf"}
{"name":"Trauma","type":"talent","img":"icons/magic/movement/abstract-ribbons-red-orange.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"trauma","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"flaw","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"trauma","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"flaws-mental","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Traumatisme (Trauma)","system":{"description":"<h1>Traumatisme (Trauma)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Un événement passé vous a laissé une blessure psychologique durable. Un type de situation, de lieu, de personne ou d’expérience agit comme déclencheur et peut provoquer peur, sidération, fuite, colère ou autre réaction adaptée au traumatisme défini.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><p>Plus le Tier est élevé, plus le déclencheur est fréquent, la réaction difficile à maîtriser ou les conséquences importantes.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Le déclencheur et la réaction doivent être déterminés avec le MJ. Lorsqu’ils surviennent, un Jet de Résistance ou une Manœuvre de Discipline peut être exigé ; l’échec entraîne une conséquence cohérente avec le traumatisme.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Trauma","system":{"description":"<h1>Trauma</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>A past event has left you with a lasting psychological wound. A type of situation, place, person, or experience acts as a trigger and may provoke fear, freezing, flight, anger, or another reaction appropriate to the defined trauma.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><p>The higher the Tier, the more common the trigger, the harder the reaction is to control, or the greater its consequences.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The trigger and reaction must be defined with the GM. When they occur, a Resistance Roll or Discipline Maneuver may be required; failure causes a consequence appropriate to the trauma.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Défauts — Mentaux"],"en":["Flaws — Mental"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["flaws-mental"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Discipline","name":"Trauma","cost":"-5/Tier","tier":0,"maxTier":3,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Trauma</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>A past event has left you with a lasting psychological wound. A type of situation, place, person, or experience acts as a trigger and may provoke fear, freezing, flight, anger, or another reaction appropriate to the defined trauma.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><p>The higher the Tier, the more common the trigger, the harder the reaction is to control, or the greater its consequences.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The trigger and reaction must be defined with the GM. When they occur, a Resistance Roll or Discipline Maneuver may be required; failure causes a consequence appropriate to the trauma.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_trauma.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"VnoXLWJ0OXEHNgl8"}
{"name":"Tree Merge","type":"talent","img":"icons/skills/movement/ball-spinning-blue.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"tree-merge","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"talent","restrictions":{"cultures":["Hommes des Bois","Woodmen"]},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"tree-merge","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"talents-cultural","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Fusion avec l’arbre (Tree Merge)","system":{"description":"<h1>Fusion avec l’arbre (Tree Merge)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous pouvez vous fondre physiquement dans un arbre vivant suffisamment grand pour contenir votre corps. Tant que la fusion est maintenue, vous êtes dissimulé dans le bois plutôt que simplement caché derrière lui. Cette aptitude est issue de traditions très particulières de la Terre du Milieu et ne constitue pas une métamorphose libre.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>La fusion exige concentration et contact avec un arbre de taille suffisante. Une fois à l’intérieur, vous ne pouvez pas vous déplacer normalement et vos perceptions du monde extérieur sont fortement limitées. Vous êtes extrêmement difficile à détecter par des moyens ordinaires. La sortie demande de rompre volontairement la fusion ; les conditions exactes et le coût d’effort sont arbitrés par le MJ conformément à la situation.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Tree Merge","system":{"description":"<h1>Tree Merge</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You can physically merge into a living tree large enough to contain your body. While the merge is maintained, you are concealed within the wood rather than merely hidden behind it. This ability comes from very particular traditions of Middle-earth and does not constitute free-form shapeshifting.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The merge requires concentration and contact with a sufficiently large tree. Once inside, you cannot move normally and your perception of the outside world is greatly limited. You are extremely difficult to detect by ordinary means. Leaving requires voluntarily breaking the merge; the exact conditions and effort cost are adjudicated by the GM according to the situation.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Talents — Culturels"],"en":["Talents — Cultural"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["talents-cultural"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Magical","name":"Tree Merge","cost":"15","tier":0,"maxTier":1,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Tree Merge</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You can physically merge into a living tree large enough to contain your body. While the merge is maintained, you are concealed within the wood rather than merely hidden behind it. This ability comes from very particular traditions of Middle-earth and does not constitute free-form shapeshifting.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The merge requires concentration and contact with a sufficiently large tree. Once inside, you cannot move normally and your perception of the outside world is greatly limited. You are extremely difficult to detect by ordinary means. Leaving requires voluntarily breaking the merge; the exact conditions and effort cost are adjudicated by the GM according to the situation.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_tree-merge.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"p2A1NYBRvGIottz2"}
{"name":"Undetectable","type":"talent","img":"icons/skills/movement/ball-spinning-blue.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"undetectable","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"talent","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"undetectable","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"talents-mystical","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Indétectable (Undetectable)","system":{"description":"<h1>Indétectable (Undetectable)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Votre présence résiste aux moyens surnaturels de détection. Divinations, scrutations et effets destinés à localiser une personne ont davantage de difficulté à vous trouver ou à vous identifier.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Vous gagnez <strong>+5 par Tier</strong> aux Jets de Résistance contre les effets de détection, divination et scrutation. Au Tier III, le MJ peut autoriser un Jet de Résistance contre certaines détections normalement passives, lorsqu’il est cohérent qu’elles puissent être trompées par ce Talent.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Undetectable","system":{"description":"<h1>Undetectable</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Your presence resists supernatural means of detection. Divinations, scrying, and effects intended to locate a person have greater difficulty finding or identifying you.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>You gain <strong>+5 per Tier</strong> to Resistance Rolls against detection, divination, and scrying effects. At Tier III, the GM may allow a Resistance Roll against certain normally passive forms of detection when it is reasonable that this Talent could deceive them.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Talents — Mystiques"],"en":["Talents — Mystical"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["talents-mystical"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Magical","name":"Undetectable","cost":"5/Tier","tier":0,"maxTier":3,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Undetectable</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Your presence resists supernatural means of detection. Divinations, scrying, and effects intended to locate a person have greater difficulty finding or identifying you.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>You gain <strong>+5 per Tier</strong> to Resistance Rolls against detection, divination, and scrying effects. At Tier III, the GM may allow a Resistance Roll against certain normally passive forms of detection when it is reasonable that this Talent could deceive them.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_undetectable.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"UXltg7fermp4vqsT"}
{"name":"Unique Looks","type":"talent","img":"icons/magic/movement/abstract-ribbons-red-orange.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"unique-looks","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"flaw","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"unique-looks","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"flaws-physical","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Apparence singulière (Unique Looks)","system":{"description":"<h1>Apparence singulière (Unique Looks)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Votre apparence possède un trait exceptionnellement reconnaissable. Ce n’est pas nécessairement laid ou monstrueux : l’important est que les témoins se souviennent de vous et puissent vous décrire avec une grande facilité.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><ul><li><strong>Tier I :</strong> détail distinctif facilement mémorisable.</li><li><strong>Tier II :</strong> apparence très inhabituelle, difficile à dissimuler.</li><li><strong>Tier III :</strong> singularité presque impossible à oublier ou à masquer sans déguisement sérieux.</li></ul><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Le MJ doit en tenir compte dans les tentatives de se fondre dans une foule, de nier une identification ou d’éviter qu’un témoin fournisse une description utile.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Unique Looks","system":{"description":"<h1>Unique Looks</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Your appearance possesses an exceptionally recognizable feature. It need not be ugly or monstrous: what matters is that witnesses remember you and can describe you with great ease.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><ul><li><strong>Tier I:</strong> a distinctive detail that is easy to remember.</li><li><strong>Tier II:</strong> a very unusual appearance that is difficult to conceal.</li><li><strong>Tier III:</strong> a feature almost impossible to forget or hide without a serious disguise.</li></ul><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The GM should take this into account when you try to blend into a crowd, deny an identification, or prevent a witness from giving a useful description.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Défauts — Physiques"],"en":["Flaws — Physical"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["flaws-physical"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Other","name":"Unique Looks","cost":"-3/Tier","tier":0,"maxTier":3,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Unique Looks</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Your appearance possesses an exceptionally recognizable feature. It need not be ugly or monstrous: what matters is that witnesses remember you and can describe you with great ease.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><ul><li><strong>Tier I:</strong> a distinctive detail that is easy to remember.</li><li><strong>Tier II:</strong> a very unusual appearance that is difficult to conceal.</li><li><strong>Tier III:</strong> a feature almost impossible to forget or hide without a serious disguise.</li></ul><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The GM should take this into account when you try to blend into a crowd, deny an identification, or prevent a witness from giving a useful description.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_unique-looks.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"aW0lbKX2S9N5vJec"}
{"name":"Unlucky","type":"talent","img":"icons/magic/movement/abstract-ribbons-red-orange.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"unlucky","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"flaw","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"unlucky","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"flaws-special","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Malchanceux (Unlucky)","system":{"description":"<h1>Malchanceux (Unlucky)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous avez moins de chance que la moyenne. Lorsque deux issues plausibles dépendent véritablement du hasard, les circonstances tendent plus souvent à se résoudre à votre désavantage.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><p>Chaque Tier augmente la fréquence ou l’importance des interventions de la malchance.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Le MJ applique ce Défaut uniquement aux situations réellement aléatoires ou aux mécanismes explicitement fondés sur la chance. Il ne s’agit pas d’une pénalité universelle à toutes les Manœuvres.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Unlucky","system":{"description":"<h1>Unlucky</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You have less luck than most. When two plausible outcomes genuinely depend on chance, circumstances tend more often to resolve to your disadvantage.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><p>Each Tier increases the frequency or significance of bad-luck interventions.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The GM applies this Flaw only to genuinely random situations or mechanisms explicitly based on luck. It is not a universal penalty to every Maneuver.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Défauts — Spéciaux"],"en":["Flaws — Special"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["flaws-special"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Other","name":"Unlucky","cost":"-5/Tier","tier":0,"maxTier":3,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Unlucky</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You have less luck than most. When two plausible outcomes genuinely depend on chance, circumstances tend more often to resolve to your disadvantage.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><p>Each Tier increases the frequency or significance of bad-luck interventions.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The GM applies this Flaw only to genuinely random situations or mechanisms explicitly based on luck. It is not a universal penalty to every Maneuver.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_unlucky.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"hmmetnrIF4Eg0uBM"}
{"name":"Unmagical","type":"talent","img":"icons/magic/movement/abstract-ribbons-red-orange.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"unmagical","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"flaw","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"unmagical","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"flaws-special","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Non-magique (Unmagical)","system":{"description":"<h1>Non-magique (Unmagical)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous avez très peu d’affinité avec la magie. Vous éprouvez une difficulté majeure à développer ou utiliser les capacités magiques.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>En MERP-RMU, le personnage éprouve de fortes difficultés à apprendre et employer la magie. Les limitations exactes sont appliquées aux Compétences et options de lancement de sorts pertinentes, sans modifier les Items du Core RMU eux-mêmes. Ce Défaut doit être incompatible avec une construction qui dépendrait normalement d’un accès aisé à la magie, sauf accord explicite du MJ.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Unmagical","system":{"description":"<h1>Unmagical</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You have very little affinity with magic. You face major difficulty developing or using magical abilities.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>In MERP-RMU, the character has great difficulty learning and using magic. The exact limitations are applied to the relevant Skills and spell-casting options without modifying RMU Core Items themselves. This Flaw should be incompatible with a character build that normally depends on easy access to magic unless the GM explicitly agrees otherwise.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Défauts — Spéciaux"],"en":["Flaws — Special"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["flaws-special"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Magical","name":"Unmagical","cost":"-15","tier":0,"maxTier":1,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Unmagical</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You have very little affinity with magic. You face major difficulty developing or using magical abilities.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>In MERP-RMU, the character has great difficulty learning and using magic. The exact limitations are applied to the relevant Skills and spell-casting options without modifying RMU Core Items themselves. This Flaw should be incompatible with a character build that normally depends on easy access to magic unless the GM explicitly agrees otherwise.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_unmagical.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"Yaxw8IheHHwfpVi4"}
{"name":"Unnatural Aging","type":"talent","img":"icons/skills/movement/ball-spinning-blue.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"unnatural-aging","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"talent","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"unnatural-aging","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"talents-mystical","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Vieillissement surnaturel (Unnatural Aging)","system":{"description":"<h1>Vieillissement surnaturel (Unnatural Aging)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Votre vieillissement ne suit pas le rythme normal de votre peuple. Le personnage peut conserver longtemps une apparence ou une vigueur inhabituelles, ou traverser les années selon une progression qui ne correspond pas à son héritage racial.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>La forme exacte de cette longévité doit être déterminée avec le MJ et rester compatible avec la Race, la Culture et l’Âge de la campagne. Le Talent ne rend pas immortel et ne protège pas des blessures, maladies ou causes de mort étrangères au vieillissement.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Unnatural Aging","system":{"description":"<h1>Unnatural Aging</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Your aging does not follow the normal pace of your people. The character may retain an unusual appearance or vigor for a very long time, or pass through the years according to a progression unlike that of their racial heritage.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The exact form of this longevity must be determined with the GM and remain compatible with the Race, Culture, and Age of the campaign. The Talent does not grant immortality and provides no protection against wounds, disease, or causes of death unrelated to aging.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Talents — Mystiques"],"en":["Talents — Mystical"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["talents-mystical"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Other","name":"Unnatural Aging","cost":"5","tier":0,"maxTier":1,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Unnatural Aging</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Your aging does not follow the normal pace of your people. The character may retain an unusual appearance or vigor for a very long time, or pass through the years according to a progression unlike that of their racial heritage.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The exact form of this longevity must be determined with the GM and remain compatible with the Race, Culture, and Age of the campaign. The Talent does not grant immortality and provides no protection against wounds, disease, or causes of death unrelated to aging.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_unnatural-aging.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"WeUyD8iaOhOfmFph"}
{"name":"Vow","type":"talent","img":"icons/magic/movement/abstract-ribbons-red-orange.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"vow","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"flaw","restrictions":{},"descriptionVersion":2,"compendiumSourceKey":"vow","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"flaws-mental","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Vœu (Vow)","system":{"description":"<h1>Vœu (Vow)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous avez prononcé un vœu qui vous impose une règle de conduite précise. Il peut s’agir d’une abstinence, d’une obligation, d’une interdiction ou d’un engagement durable. Plus le vœu est grave, plus il doit réellement limiter les solutions accessibles au personnage.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><p>Les Tiers représentent l’importance et la contrainte du vœu, depuis une obligation notable mais circonscrite jusqu’à un engagement majeur susceptible d’orienter toute une vie.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Le contenu du vœu est validé par le MJ. Un vœu formulé de manière à ne jamais gêner le personnage ne mérite pas le bénéfice du Défaut.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Vow","system":{"description":"<h1>Vow</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You have sworn a vow imposing a precise rule of conduct. It may involve abstinence, an obligation, a prohibition, or a lasting commitment. The more serious the vow, the more it must genuinely restrict the solutions available to the character.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><p>The Tiers represent the importance and restrictiveness of the vow, from a notable but limited obligation to a major commitment capable of shaping an entire life.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The content of the vow is approved by the GM. A vow worded so that it never inconveniences the character does not justify the benefit of the Flaw.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Défauts — Mentaux"],"en":["Flaws — Mental"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["flaws-mental"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Other","name":"Vow","cost":"-5/Tier","tier":0,"maxTier":4,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Vow</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You have sworn a vow imposing a precise rule of conduct. It may involve abstinence, an obligation, a prohibition, or a lasting commitment. The more serious the vow, the more it must genuinely restrict the solutions available to the character.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><p>The Tiers represent the importance and restrictiveness of the vow, from a notable but limited obligation to a major commitment capable of shaping an entire life.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The content of the vow is approved by the GM. A vow worded so that it never inconveniences the character does not justify the benefit of the Flaw.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_vow.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"KtDkZ0aOo3LnJQpf"}
{"name":"Way of the Woods","type":"talent","img":"icons/skills/movement/ball-spinning-blue.webp","effects":[],"ownership":{"default":0},"flags":{"merp-ui":{"key":"way-of-the-woods","collection":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws-v2","source":"RMSS/RMFRP","kind":"talent","restrictions":{"cultures":["Luindrim"]},"descriptionVersion":3,"compendiumSourceKey":"way-of-the-woods","compendiumPack":"merp-rmu-talents-flaws","compendiumSourceFile":"data/merp-rmu/talents-flaws-v2.json","compendiumFolderKey":"talents-cultural","compendiumBuildLanguage":"en","compendiumLocalizations":{"fr":{"name":"Voie des Bois (Way of the Woods)","system":{"description":"<h1>Voie des Bois (Way of the Woods)</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>Vous possédez une affinité remarquable avec les arbres et la végétation forestière. Dans un terrain boisé naturel, vous vous déplacez, grimpez, vous dissimulez et franchissez les obstacles avec une aisance inhabituelle.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><p>Chaque Tier accorde <strong>+5</strong> aux Manœuvres physiques directement liées au terrain forestier, jusqu’à +10 au Tier II.</p><h2>Adaptation MERP-RMU</h2><p>Le bonus ne s’applique pas à toutes les actions accomplies en forêt, mais uniquement lorsque la nature du terrain boisé joue réellement un rôle dans la Manœuvre.</p>"}},"en":{"name":"Way of the Woods","system":{"description":"<h1>Way of the Woods</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You possess a remarkable affinity with trees and forest vegetation. In natural wooded terrain, you move, climb, hide, and cross obstacles with unusual ease.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><p>Each Tier grants <strong>+5</strong> to physical Maneuvers directly related to forest terrain, up to +10 at Tier II.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The bonus does not apply to every action performed in a forest, only when the nature of the wooded terrain genuinely plays a role in the Maneuver.</p>"}}},"compendiumAgeVariants":null,"compendiumFolderPath":{"fr":["Talents — Culturels"],"en":["Talents — Cultural"]},"compendiumFolderKeyPath":["talents-cultural"],"compendiumResolverBacked":false}},"system":{"book":"MERP-RMU","category":"Physical","name":"Way of the Woods","cost":"8/Tier","tier":0,"maxTier":2,"discount":"x1","dpSpent":0,"description":"<h1>Way of the Woods</h1><h2>Description</h2><p>You possess a remarkable affinity with trees and forest vegetation. In natural wooded terrain, you move, climb, hide, and cross obstacles with unusual ease.</p><h2>Tiers</h2><p>Each Tier grants <strong>+5</strong> to physical Maneuvers directly related to forest terrain, up to +10 at Tier II.</p><h2>MERP-RMU Adaptation</h2><p>The bonus does not apply to every action performed in a forest, only when the nature of the wooded terrain genuinely plays a role in the Maneuver.</p>","skill":null,"attack":null,"filename":"merp_way-of-the-woods.yaml","modifiers":[]},"_id":"VvUtV9t5Za5kLvnk"}
